INSERT INTO _pf (name,type,flavor) VALUES
  ('10th Avenue Amber','Beer','Rich caramel and toasted malt lead the way, with subtle notes of toffee, light nuttiness, and a hint of earthy hop bitterness in the background. Medium-bodied with a smooth, balanced mouthfeel, it finishes clean and slightly sweet without being heavy.'),
  ('2018 La Louviere Rouge Pessac-Leognan','Red','Dark currant, blackberry, and cedar lead with an undercurrent of tobacco, graphite, and subtle earthy minerality. The palate is medium-to-full bodied with well-integrated, firm tannins and bright but balanced acidity that gives it excellent structure. The finish is long and elegant, with lingering hints of dark fruit and a touch of mocha.'),
  ('2018 Roland Champion Grand Cru ''Special Club''','Sparkling Wine','Bright and precise, with ripe golden apple, brioche, roasted hazelnut, and a delicate thread of white flowers and chalk minerality. The mousse is fine and persistent, the body medium-full with vibrant, mouthwatering acidity keeping everything lifted and fresh. The finish is long and saline, with lingering notes of toasted almond and lemon curd.'),
  ('2018 Royal Tokaji Red Label 5 Puttonyos 500ml','Dessert','Rich and lusciously sweet with concentrated apricot, orange marmalade, dried mango, and candied ginger layered over notes of honey, saffron, and toasted brioche. The acidity is strikingly vibrant for a dessert wine, cutting through the sweetness to deliver remarkable freshness and balance. The finish is long and elegant, with lingering notes of beeswax, vanilla, and a subtle earthy minerality characteristic of the Tokaj region.'),
  ('2019 Belles Graves Lalande de Pomerol','Red','Rich black cherry, plum, and cassis lead with subtle notes of dark chocolate, cedar, and a hint of violet. The palate is round and plush with velvety tannins, medium-full body, and well-integrated acidity typical of the Right Bank. The finish is warm and persistent with earthy, truffle-like depth.'),
  ('2019 Sesti Brunello di Montalcino','Red','Dark cherry, dried rose, and iron-tinged earth anchor the palate, with layers of leather, tobacco, and a subtle hint of dark chocolate emerging with time in the glass. Full-bodied with firm, well-structured tannins and bright, lifting acidity that keeps everything in balance. The finish is long and mineral-driven, fading with elegant notes of dried herbs and spice.'),
  ('2020 Guido Porro Barolo ''Vigna Lazzairasco''','Red','Dark cherry, dried rose, and tar lead into layers of licorice, leather, and iron-tinged earth, with a backbone of firm, well-integrated tannins and bright, mouthwatering acidity. The body is full and structured, with a savory, slightly dusty quality characteristic of Serralunga d''Alba''s powerful style. The finish is long and austere, lingering with dried herbs and a mineral, almost smoky persistence.'),
  ('2021 Chakana Estate Malbec','Red','Deep violet fruit — blackberry, black plum, and ripe blueberry — layered with notes of dark chocolate, violet flowers, and a hint of smoky oak. The body is full and plush with velvety, well-integrated tannins and balanced acidity. The finish is long and warm, lingering with subtle spice and a touch of mocha.'),
  ('2021 Fullerton Five Faces Chardonnay','White','Bright and expressive, with ripe peach, golden apple, and toasted brioche layered over hints of vanilla and light citrus zest. The palate is medium-bodied with creamy texture, well-integrated oak, and refreshing acidity that keeps it lively. The finish is smooth and lingering with a subtle butterscotch warmth.'),
  ('2021 Hirsch San Andreas Fault Pinot Noir','Red','Dark cherry, wild strawberry, and dried rose petals lead with a savory undercurrent of forest floor and subtle smoked herb. Medium-bodied with bright, mouthwatering acidity and silky, fine-grained tannins that reflect the cool Sonoma Coast terroir. The finish is long and mineral-driven, with lingering red fruit and a flinty, earth-toned complexity.'),
  ('2021 Pascaul Clement Puligny Montrachet','White','Bright and precise, with lemon curd, white peach, and toasted hazelnut layered over a mineral, chalky backbone. Medium-to-full bodied with vibrant acidity that keeps everything lifted and fresh. The finish is long and saline, with lingering notes of brioche and white flowers.'),
  ('2021 Podere Campriano Chianti Classico Riserva','Red','Dark cherry, dried plum, and iron-tinged earth lead the nose, with layers of tobacco, dried herbs, and a hint of leather emerging as the wine opens. The palate is medium-full bodied with firm but polished Sangiovese tannins, bright acidity, and flavors of sour cherry, balsamic, and roasted tomato. The finish is long and savory, with a lingering note of dried violet and subtle oak spice.'),
  ('2021 Sang de Cailloux Vacqueyras Rouge','Red','Dark cherry, black olive, and garrigue lead with a streak of crushed violet and iron-rich earth underneath. The palate is full-bodied with firm, well-integrated tannins, bright southern Rhône acidity, and layers of dried herbs, smoked meat, and leather. The finish is long and savory with a lingering note of black pepper and wild scrubland.'),
  ('2021 Schramsberg Blanc de Blanc 375ml','Sparkling Wine','Bright and elegant, with crisp green apple, lemon curd, and white peach aromas leading into a palate of toasted brioche, citrus zest, and a hint of honeysuckle. It has vibrant acidity and fine, persistent bubbles that give it a lively, refreshing character. The finish is clean and minerally with a subtle creamy richness.'),
  ('2021 Shea Cellars Estate Pinot Noir','Red','Dark cherry, fresh raspberry, and dried rose petal lead with a subtle undercurrent of forest floor, cardamom, and toasted oak. The palate is silky and medium-bodied with bright, lifted acidity and fine-grained tannins that give it elegant structure without weight. The finish is long and savory, lingering with hints of black tea and warm spice.'),
  ('2022 Ancient Peaks Merlot','Red','Ripe black cherry, plum, and dark chocolate lead with hints of vanilla, cedar, and a touch of dried herbs. The body is medium-full with smooth, approachable tannins and balanced acidity that keeps it fresh. The finish is soft and lingering, with a warm mocha and berry character.'),
  ('2022 Auctioneer Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Dark blackcurrant, ripe plum, and black cherry lead, supported by notes of cedar, toasted oak, and a hint of cocoa. The body is full and structured with firm but polished tannins and balanced acidity. The finish is long and smooth, lingering with subtle vanilla and a touch of earthy tobacco.'),
  ('2022 Bastian Jolivet St. Joseph "Clef de Sol"','White','Bright and aromatic with white peach, apricot, and honeysuckle, underpinned by subtle floral notes and a whisper of almond. Medium-bodied with lively acidity and a creamy, almost waxy texture characteristic of Marsanne and Roussanne from the northern Rhône. The finish is long and mineral, with a gentle nutty richness that lingers pleasantly.'),
  ('2022 Chateau Retout Haut-Medoc','Red','Dark cherry, blackcurrant, and cedar lead with subtle graphite and dried herb undertones. Medium-full bodied with firm but polished tannins and lively acidity that gives it structure and freshness. The finish is clean and moderately long with a hint of tobacco and earthy minerality.'),
  ('2022 Cliff Lede Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Dark cassis, blackberry, and ripe plum lead with layered notes of cedar, mocha, and a hint of violet. Full-bodied with plush, well-integrated tannins and lively acidity that keeps it from feeling heavy. The finish is long, warm, and dusted with cocoa and subtle toasted oak.'),
  ('2022 Far Niente Post & Beam Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Dark cherry, blackcurrant, and ripe plum lead with hints of cocoa, cedar, and a touch of vanilla from oak aging. The body is full yet approachable, with polished, velvety tannins and well-integrated acidity that keep it balanced. The finish is long and smooth, lingering with notes of mocha and warm spice.'),
  ('2022 Gerard & Morin Sancerre ''Chene Marchand''','White','Bright and precise, with lively notes of white grapefruit, green apple, and fresh lemon zest layered over a signature flinty minerality and subtle hints of white flower and wet stone. The palate is lean and focused with vibrant, mouthwatering acidity and a medium-light body typical of Loire Sauvignon Blanc from the Chêne Marchand lieu-dit. The finish is clean, long, and distinctly chalky, with a lingering citrus and saline quality.'),
  ('2022 Gros Nore Bandol Rouge','Red','Dark, brooding Mourvèdre-driven wine with concentrated notes of blackberry, black olive, garrigue, and smoked meat, underscored by hints of leather and dried herbs. Full-bodied with firm, grippy tannins and lively acidity that give it real structure and depth. The finish is long and earthy, with a savory, mineral persistence that lingers well.'),
  ('2022 Guillemot Sauvigny-Les-Beaune ''Les Grands Picotins''','Red','Bright red cherry, wild strawberry, and a whisper of violet lead the way, underscored by earthy Burgundian notes of forest floor and a touch of dried rose. The palate is light-to-medium bodied with silky, refined tannins and lively acidity that keeps everything lifted and precise. The finish is elegant and lingering, with a subtle minerality and a hint of spice.'),
  ('2022 Leonetti Cellars Merlot','Red','Rich dark cherry, plum, and blackberry lead with layers of mocha, cedar, and a hint of violet. The body is full and plush, with velvety, well-integrated tannins and bright but balanced acidity. The finish is long and elegant, leaving notes of dark chocolate and subtle spice.'),
  ('2022 Nickle & Nickle Branding Iron Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Rich and concentrated with ripe blackberry, black currant, and dark cherry at the core, layered with notes of mocha, cedar, and a hint of toasted vanilla from oak aging. The palate is full-bodied with plush, well-structured tannins and bright acidity that keeps it lively. The finish is long and velvety, leaving lingering impressions of dark fruit and subtle earthy minerality.'),
  ('2022 Punta Crena Vermentino ''Vigneto Isasco''','White','Bright and saline-driven, with zesty lemon pith, white peach, and crushed herb aromas alongside a distinctive mineral, almost chalky character from the Ligurian coastal terroir. The palate is medium-bodied with brisk, mouthwatering acidity and notes of green almond and dried flowers. The finish is clean, long, and pleasantly bitter — a classic Ligurian signature.'),
  ('2022 Riofavara Nero d''Avola ''Spaccaforno''','Red','Dark cherry, ripe plum, and dried fig lead with undertones of licorice, tobacco, and a hint of sun-dried herbs. The wine is full-bodied with velvety, well-integrated tannins and bright acidity that keeps it lively despite its richness. The finish is long and warm, with lingering notes of dark spice and a touch of earthy minerality.'),
  ('2022 Savary Chablis ''Vaillons''','White','Crisp and precise, with green apple, lemon zest, and white peach over a distinct minerality reminiscent of wet chalk and sea shells. The palate is medium-bodied with bright, mouthwatering acidity and subtle notes of oyster shell and dried herbs. The finish is long, clean, and stony.'),
  ('2022 Vinum Pinot Noir','Red','Bright red cherry, raspberry, and dried rose petal lead the nose and palate, with subtle earthy undertones of forest floor and a whisper of toasted oak. The body is light to medium with silky, refined tannins and lively acidity that keeps it fresh and vibrant. The finish is clean and moderately long, with a lingering hint of spice and red fruit.'),
  ('2023 Anne Pichon ''Sauvage'' Viognier','White','Bursting with ripe peach, apricot, and white flowers, with subtle notes of honeysuckle and a hint of ginger spice. The wine is full-bodied with a lush, almost oily texture, balanced by bright acidity that keeps it fresh and lifted. The finish is long and fragrant, lingering with floral and stone fruit notes.'),
  ('2023 Averaen Pinot Noir','Red','Bright red cherry, raspberry, and pomegranate lead with subtle notes of dried rose petal and forest floor. Medium-bodied with silky, refined tannins and lively acidity that keeps the palate fresh. The finish is clean and elegant, lingering with a hint of warm spice and vanilla oak.'),
  ('2023 Broc Cellars ''Amore Rosso''','Red','Bright and playful, with fresh strawberry, dried cherry, and a hint of crushed violet on the nose and palate. Light-bodied with lively acidity, soft tannins, and a touch of earthy spice that keeps it grounded. The finish is clean, juicy, and refreshingly short — easy-drinking with real character.'),
  ('2023 Bruno Colin Bourgogne Chardonnay','White','Bright and fresh with notes of green apple, lemon zest, and white peach, underscored by a subtle chalky minerality. Medium-bodied with lively acidity and a restrained touch of creamy texture from light oak influence. The finish is clean, crisp, and lingering with a hint of almond.'),
  ('2023 Chave Selections Croze Hermitage Rouge ''Silene''','Red','Dark cherry, blackberry, and olive tapenade lead with hints of cracked black pepper, smoked meat, and dried herbs characteristic of Northern Rhône Syrah. The wine is medium-to-full bodied with firm but polished tannins, lively acidity, and a savory, iron-tinged minerality running throughout. The finish is long and earthy, with lingering violet and spice.'),
  ('2023 Cliff Lede Sauvignon Blanc','White','Bright and zesty with vibrant notes of grapefruit, white peach, and fresh-cut grass, layered with hints of lemongrass and a subtle minerality. It''s medium-bodied with lively acidity that keeps everything crisp and refreshing. The finish is clean and lingering, with a bright citrus zest that fades elegantly.'),
  ('2023 Clos Coutale Cahors Malbec','Red','Dark plum, blackberry, and violet lead, backed by earthy leather, tobacco, and a hint of smoked meat characteristic of Cahors Malbec. The wine is full-bodied with firm, grippy tannins and lively acidity that keeps it fresh. The finish is long and savory, with lingering notes of dark fruit and a touch of mineral graphite.'),
  ('2023 Clos Saint Magdeliene Cassis Blanc','White','Bright and precise, with vivid notes of white peach, citrus zest, and wild fennel layered over a saline, mineral backbone that reflects its limestone coastal terroir. The body is medium, with crisp, mouthwatering acidity and a subtle herbal garrigue quality. The finish is long, clean, and strikingly salty — almost briny — with lingering citrus pith.'),
  ('2023 D''Epire Savennieres','White','Bone-dry and mineral-driven, with concentrated green apple, quince, and white blossom aromas underpinned by a distinctive wet slate and beeswax character. The body is full and textured for a white wine, with laser-sharp acidity that gives it an almost electric tension on the palate. The finish is long and saline, with a lingering citrus pith bitterness that rewards slow sipping.'),
  ('2023 Domaine Trotereau Quincy','White','Crisp and mineral-driven, with bright citrus notes of lemon zest and grapefruit alongside fresh-cut grass, white peach, and a subtle floral lift. The palate is lean and focused with lively, mouthwatering acidity and a clean saline edge typical of the Quincy appellation. The finish is dry, refreshing, and lingering with a flinty, chalky minerality.'),
  ('2023 Far Niente Chardonnay','White','Rich and opulent with ripe peach, honeyed apple, and toasted brioche layered over hints of vanilla and crème brûlée from careful oak aging. The palate is full-bodied and creamy with balanced acidity that keeps it fresh and lively. The finish is long and silky, lingering with notes of butterscotch and a touch of citrus zest.'),
  ('2023 Fossil Point Chardonnay','White','Bright and approachable, with ripe peach, golden apple, and a hint of toasted vanilla from light oak influence. The palate is medium-bodied with refreshing acidity that keeps it lively, balanced by a touch of creamy texture. The finish is clean and moderately long, with a subtle note of citrus zest.'),
  ('2023 Gundlach Bundchu Mountain Cuvee','Red','Dark cherry, blackberry, and plum lead with subtle notes of dried herbs, mocha, and a hint of toasted oak. The wine is medium-to-full bodied with smooth, well-integrated tannins and balanced acidity that keeps it lively. The finish is long and warm, closing with lingering dark fruit and a touch of spice.'),
  ('2023 Hietz Eifel Riesling Kabinett','White','Crisp and light-bodied with bright green apple, white peach, and lemon zest up front, layered with delicate floral notes and a hint of slate minerality. Lively acidity keeps it refreshing, while a touch of residual sweetness balances beautifully without feeling heavy. The finish is clean and lingering with a subtle citrus peel bite.'),
  ('2023 Isenhower Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Dark blackberry, cassis, and ripe plum lead with hints of cedar, dark chocolate, and a touch of dusty sage. The wine is full-bodied with firm but well-integrated tannins and lively acidity that keeps it fresh. The finish is long and warm, lingering with notes of toasted oak and a subtle earthy minerality.'),
  ('2023 Kermit Lynch Cotes du Rhone','Red','Ripe red cherry, wild garrigue herbs, and a hint of black olive lead the nose and palate, with a touch of cracked black pepper typical of southern Rhône blends. Medium-bodied with soft, approachable tannins, bright acidity, and a earthy, sun-warmed quality that gives it rustic charm. The finish is clean and moderately long with a pleasant savory lift.'),
  ('2023 La Tour Vielle Banyuls ''Rimage'' 500ml','Dessert','Dark cherry, blackberry preserve, and bittersweet chocolate lead, layered with notes of espresso, dried fig, and a hint of orange zest. It''s full-bodied and richly sweet with a velvety texture, balanced by the grape spirit''s gentle warmth. The finish is long and lingering, with cocoa powder and a subtle briny minerality characteristic of the Roussillon coast.'),
  ('2023 Mienklang Burgenland Osterreich Red','Red','Ripe dark cherry, plum, and a hint of dried herbs lead the way, underscored by subtle earthy, peppery notes characteristic of Burgenland reds. The wine is medium-bodied with soft, approachable tannins and lively acidity that keeps it fresh. The finish is smooth and moderately long, with a touch of warm spice lingering pleasantly.'),
  ('2023 Neboa Albarino','White','Bright and refreshing with lively notes of white peach, citrus zest, and green apple, underscored by a saline, mineral quality characteristic of Galicia''s coastal vineyards. Medium-bodied with crisp, mouthwatering acidity and a subtle floral hint of jasmine. The finish is clean and lingering, with a squeeze of lemon and a briny, sea-spray lift.'),
  ('2023 Picpoul Pomerols','White','Bright and zesty with lemon zest, green apple, and white peach, underscored by a distinctive saline, sea-breeze minerality. It''s light-bodied with piercing, mouth-watering acidity that keeps it crisp and refreshing throughout. The finish is clean and brisk with a lingering citrus and chalky mineral note.'),
  ('2023 Ridge Three Valleys Zinfandel','Red','Bursting with ripe blackberry, raspberry jam, and dried cranberry, with warm notes of black pepper, cinnamon, and a hint of dark chocolate. The body is full and generous, with plush, well-integrated tannins and lively acidity that keeps the richness in check. The finish is long and spicy, with lingering bramble fruit and a touch of toasty oak.'),
  ('2023 Roumier Lacoste Sauternes 375ml','Dessert','Lush and concentrated with honeyed apricot, candied orange peel, and ripe peach layered over notes of saffron, ginger, and toasted brioche. The palate is full-bodied and opulent, with bright acidity keeping the sweetness lifted and elegant rather than cloying. The finish is long and complex, lingering with hints of crème brûlée and dried mango.'),
  ('2023 Saint Marie Bourgogne Blanc','White','Crisp and focused, with bright green apple, lemon zest, and white peach backed by subtle notes of toasted brioche and wet stone minerality. Medium-bodied with lively acidity and a clean, lingering finish that carries a chalky, flinty character.'),
  ('2023 Vajra Langhe Bianco ''Dragon''','White','Crisp and aromatic with notes of white peach, lemon zest, Alpine wildflowers, and a hint of fennel frond. Medium-light bodied with lively acidity and a subtle mineral, stony undercurrent. The finish is clean and refreshing with a delicate herbal lift.'),
  ('2023 Vieux Telegraphe Chateauneuf du Pape','Red','Rich, sun-warmed black cherry, dried fig, and garrigue — a wild herbal scrubland quality with hints of leather, iron, and cracked black pepper woven throughout. The body is full and generous with a silky, structured tannic presence and lively underlying acidity that keeps it from feeling heavy. The finish is long and earthy, lingering with notes of roasted herbs and a subtle smoky minerality.'),
  ('2023 Zuccardi Q Malbec','Red','Deep violet-hued with concentrated aromas of blackberry, plum, and violet, layered with hints of dark chocolate and subtle oak spice. On the palate it''s full-bodied and velvety, with ripe, structured tannins and lively acidity that keeps the fruit feeling fresh rather than heavy. The finish is long and polished, lingering with notes of mocha and dried herbs.'),
  ('2024 Brisa Suave Vihno Verde 1 Liter','White','Bright and zesty with notes of green apple, lemon zest, and white peach, underscored by a subtle floral lift. Light-bodied with refreshing, mouthwatering acidity and a faint natural spritz that keeps it lively on the palate. The finish is clean, crisp, and slightly mineral with a whisper of citrus peel.'),
  ('2024 Caldaro Pinot Grigio','White','Bright and crisp, with notes of green apple, white peach, and lemon zest, underscored by a subtle mineral quality and hints of almond. The body is light to medium with refreshing, vibrant acidity that keeps the palate clean. The finish is short and dry, with a pleasant citrus lift.'),
  ('2024 Chateau Ducasse Blanc','White','Bright and refreshing with notes of white peach, lemon zest, and fresh-cut grass, underpinned by subtle floral hints of acacia. The palate is light to medium-bodied with lively acidity and a clean, mineral-driven edge. The finish is crisp and pleasantly brief with a touch of citrus pith.'),
  ('2024 Field Recordings Skins Orange','Rosé','Bright and textural, this skin-contact rosé opens with notes of dried apricot, peach pit, and chamomile, layered with a subtle tannic grip from extended skin contact. The body is medium and juicy with vibrant acidity and earthy, slightly oxidative undertones of orange blossom and dried herbs. The finish is long, pleasantly bitter, and nutty with a lingering golden fruit character.'),
  ('2024 Fontsainte Gris de Gris Rose','Rosé','Pale copper in hue, this Languedoc rosé opens with delicate notes of wild strawberry, dried rose petal, and a hint of Provençal herbs. It''s light-bodied with crisp, refreshing acidity and a subtle saline minerality that gives it real coastal character. The finish is clean and dry, lingering with a whisper of white peach and citrus zest.'),
  ('2024 Friend & Farmer Tempranillo','Red','Bold dark cherry and blackberry fruit lead, layered with earthy leather, dried herbs, and a hint of tobacco. Medium-to-full body with firm but approachable tannins and lively acidity that keeps it fresh. The finish is long and savory with lingering notes of cedar and spice.'),
  ('2024 Leccia Ill de Beaute Rose','Rosé','Bright and fresh on the palate with notes of wild strawberry, white peach, and crushed rose petal, underscored by a subtle herbal garrigue character typical of Corsican viticulture. Medium-bodied with lively acidity and a clean, mineral-driven finish that lingers with a hint of citrus zest.'),
  ('2024 Lover Rose','Rosé','Bright and fresh with notes of wild strawberry, watermelon, and white peach, accented by a hint of rose petal and citrus zest. It''s light-bodied with lively acidity and a touch of minerality that keeps it crisp and refreshing. The finish is clean and delicate, with a lingering whisper of red fruit.'),
  ('2024 Meinklang Osterriech Orange','Rosé','Vibrant notes of dried apricot, peach skin, and chamomile are layered with a subtle tannic grip and earthy, herbal undertones characteristic of extended skin contact. The body is medium with a bright, energetic acidity that keeps everything lively and fresh. The finish is long and slightly grippy, with lingering hints of orange peel and wildflower honey.'),
  ('2024 Pallieres ''Au Petite Bonheur'' Rose','Rosé','Bright and refreshing with notes of wild strawberry, dried Provençal herbs, and a subtle mineral, stony undertone. It''s light-bodied with crisp, mouthwatering acidity and a touch of white peach on the palate. The finish is clean, dry, and elegantly brief with a lingering floral lift.'),
  ('2024 Pratsch Grunerveltiner 1 Liter','White','Crisp and refreshing with classic Grüner Veltliner notes of green apple, white pepper, and citrus zest, backed by subtle hints of fresh herbs and stone fruit. Medium-bodied with bright, lively acidity and a clean mineral backbone. The finish is dry, brisk, and pleasantly peppery.'),
  ('2024 Raptor Ridge Cuvee Pinot Noir','Red','Bright red cherry, fresh raspberry, and subtle violet aromatics lead into a silky, medium-bodied palate with earthy undertones of forest floor and dried herbs. Soft, well-integrated tannins and lively acidity keep the wine fresh and elegant. The finish is clean and lingering with a gentle hint of spice and red fruit.'),
  ('2024 Raptor Ridge Pinot Gris','White','Bright and aromatic, with notes of ripe pear, honeydew melon, and white peach layered over hints of jasmine and a subtle spice. Medium-bodied with lively acidity and a touch of creaminess on the palate. The finish is clean and refreshing with a lingering stone fruit sweetness.'),
  ('2024 Satellite Sauvignon Blanc','White','Bright and zesty with vivid notes of grapefruit, fresh-cut grass, and white peach, underpinned by a hint of passionfruit. The palate is light to medium-bodied with lively, mouthwatering acidity that keeps it crisp and refreshing. The finish is clean and lingering with a subtle citrus pith bite.'),
  ('2024 Thierry Germain Saumur Champigny','Red','Bright red cherry, fresh raspberry, and violet lead the way, underpinned by subtle pencil shaving and cool graphite notes characteristic of Loire Cabernet Franc. It''s medium-bodied with lively acidity, fine-grained tannins, and a juicy, almost crunchy texture. The finish is clean and minerally with a lingering hint of herb and crushed stone.'),
  ('2024 Thivin Cote de Brouilly','Red','Ripe black cherry, wild blueberry, and crushed violet lead the palate, underpinned by subtle notes of graphite and wet stone that reflect the volcanic blue schist soils of the Côte de Brouilly. Medium-bodied with lively acidity and silky, almost imperceptible tannins, the wine has a juicy, fresh energy throughout. The finish is clean and mineral-driven, lingering with a touch of spice and floral lift.'),
  ('2024 Tiamo Organic Pinot Grigio','White','Crisp and light-bodied with fresh notes of green apple, lemon zest, and white peach, underscored by a subtle floral hint. Bright, clean acidity keeps the palate lively, while a touch of almond on the dry, refreshing finish adds gentle complexity.'),
  ('2024 Tour de Bon Bandol Rose','Rosé','Bright and precise, with fresh strawberry, wild herbs, and a subtle hint of white peach and citrus zest. The palate is medium-bodied with lively acidity and a minerally, almost stony backbone characteristic of Mourvèdre-driven Bandol rosé. The finish is clean and lingering with a pleasing saline quality.'),
  ('Athletic Run Wild IPA NA 12oz Can','Beer','Bright citrus and tropical fruit notes — grapefruit, passion fruit, and a hint of pine — lead the way, backed by a clean, slightly bready malt base. The bitterness is moderate and well-balanced, giving it the character of a proper West Coast IPA without any harshness. The finish is crisp and refreshing, with no alcoholic heat and a light, dry fade.'),
  ('Bauman''s Oak St. Dry Cider','Cider','Crisp and bone-dry with bright green apple and fresh-pressed juice up front, layered with subtle earthy oak undertones and a hint of citrus zest. Medium-bodied with lively acidity that keeps it refreshing and clean. The finish is long and slightly tannic, with a satisfying dryness that lingers.'),
  ('Bear''s Delight Honey Wheat','Beer','Soft and approachable, with notes of fresh wildflower honey, ripe banana, and a gentle hint of clove from the wheat malt. The body is light to medium with a subtle sweetness that never feels cloying, balanced by a mild, crisp carbonation. The finish is clean and slightly grainy, with lingering floral honey warmth.'),
  ('Black Saddle','Cocktail','Rich and warming, with bold rye spice and dark caramel leading into deep notes of roasted coffee and bittersweet chocolate. The maple syrup adds a smooth, earthy sweetness that rounds out the whiskey''s assertive character without making it cloying. The finish is long and slightly smoky, with lingering cocoa and a gentle bite of rye.'),
  ('Blue Samurai','Cocktail','Bright and refreshing with crisp citrus notes of yuzu and lemon zest layered over a clean, slightly sweet sake base, with a subtle hint of blue curaçao adding a light orange blossom sweetness. The body is light and well-balanced, with a lively acidity that keeps it vivid on the palate. The finish is clean and mildly floral with a gentle, lingering citrus warmth.'),
  ('Bud Light 12oz Bottle','Beer','Crisp and very light-bodied with subtle notes of grain and mild hops, offering a clean, slightly sweet cereal character. Low bitterness and high carbonation keep it refreshing and easy-drinking, with a short, clean finish.'),
  ('Budweiser 12oz Bottle','Beer','Light, crisp, and clean with subtle notes of grainy malt, faint sweetness, and a mild hop bitterness. The body is thin to medium with a smooth, highly carbonated texture. The finish is short and refreshing with little lingering flavor.'),
  ('Coors Banquet 12oz Bottle','Beer','Clean and crisp with light notes of sweet corn, mild grain, and a faint hint of honey. It has a light-to-medium body with low bitterness and gentle carbonation that keeps it refreshing and easy-drinking. The finish is short and clean with a subtle malty sweetness.'),
  ('Coors Light 12oz Bottle','Beer','Crisp and clean with very light notes of pale grain, faint corn sweetness, and a subtle hint of floral hops. Extremely light-bodied with high carbonation and mild bitterness. The finish is short and refreshing with virtually no lingering aftertaste.'),
  ('Corona Extra 12oz Bottle','Beer','Light and crisp with subtle notes of grain, mild honey sweetness, and a faint hint of citrus zest. The body is very light with low bitterness and a clean, refreshing effervescence. The finish is short and dry, making it an easy-drinking, approachable lager.'),
  ('Crown & Cane','Cocktail','Warm, ripe banana leads the palate, layered with bright ginger spice and a floral honey sweetness that balances the rum''s aged caramel depth. Fresh lemon lifts the richness and keeps the sip lively and refreshing. The finish is smooth and lingering, with a gentle heat from the ginger and a tropical sweetness that echoes the candied garnish.'),
  ('Dow''s Tawny Porto 10 Year','Port','Rich notes of dried fig, golden raisin, roasted hazelnut, and orange peel lead into caramel and toasted almond on the mid-palate, with a gentle hint of cinnamon and vanilla. Medium-full bodied with a soft, mellow sweetness balanced by a bright, refreshing acidity that sets it apart from ruby-style ports. The finish is long, warm, and nutty with a pleasant oxidative complexity.'),
  ('Fanta Orange, Grape & Strawberry','N/A','**Fanta Orange, Grape & Strawberry**
INSERT INTO _pp (dish,bev,bevtype,ai,house,sort) VALUES
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2021 Chakana Estate Malbec','Red','Argentine chimichurri is a natural homeland pairing with Malbec — the wine''s bright acidity and violet fruit cut through the herbaceous garlic-oregano sauce while echoing its red pepper spice.',NULL,1),
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2021 Sang de Cailloux Vacqueyras Rouge','Red','Argentine chimichurri''s oregano, garlic, and red pepper mirror the wild garrigue and herbal scrubland character of this Vacqueyras, making it an instinctive companion whenever the wine is poured alongside grilled or roasted beef.',NULL,3),
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2022 Riofavara Nero d''Avola ''Spaccaforno''','Red','The Argentine Chimichurri''s herbaceous oregano and garlic hit the sun-dried herb and licorice undertones in this wine beautifully, while the red pepper''s gentle heat plays off the wine''s warm, spiced finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2023 Clos Coutale Cahors Malbec','Red','Argentine chimichurri''s bright acidity and herbal punch mirror the wine''s violet and fresh fruit notes while cutting through its tannins, making this a classic South American-style pairing that energizes both the sauce and the Malbec.',NULL,2),
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2023 Kermit Lynch Cotes du Rhone','Red','The chimichurri''s oregano, garlic, and red pepper are a near-mirror image of the wine''s wild garrigue and peppery character, making this a classic Provençal-meets-Argentine herb synergy when draped over any cut at the table.',NULL,3),
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2023 Ridge Three Valleys Zinfandel','Red','The herby, garlicky brightness of the chimichurri contrasts the wine''s dark fruit richness and provides a fresh counterpoint to its toasty oak, making it an ideal pairing alongside any grilled red meat on the table.',NULL,2),
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2023 Vieux Telegraphe Chateauneuf du Pape','Red','The herbaceous oregano, garlic, and red pepper in the chimichurri echo the wine''s wild garrigue character directly, creating a seamless bridge between the sauce and the Rhône''s sun-drenched herbal scrubland notes.',NULL,3),
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2023 Zuccardi Q Malbec','Red','This is a regional love story: Argentine chimichurri''s bright herbaceous garlic and oregano complement the Malbec''s dried-herb undertones while the acidity in both the sauce and the wine keep each other lively rather than heavy.',NULL,1),
  ('Argentine Chimichurri','2024 Friend & Farmer Tempranillo','Red','The wine''s earthy leather and dried herb character mirrors chimichurri''s oregano and garlic, while its bright acidity aligns beautifully with the sauce''s red pepper bite — a classic Argentine pairing that amplifies both.',NULL,1),
  ('Australian Wagyu Ribeye (12 oz)','2022 Cliff Lede Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Australian Wagyu''s intensely marbled fat is tamed by the wine''s lively acidity, and the cedar and toasted oak notes elegantly echo the beefy richness without overwhelming the delicate Wagyu flavor.',NULL,1),
  ('Australian Wagyu Ribeye (12 oz)','2022 Nickle & Nickle Branding Iron Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Australian Wagyu''s intense intramuscular fat needs the wine''s bright acidity and firm tannin structure to cleanse the palate, while the mocha and vanilla oak notes complement the beef''s natural buttery richness.',NULL,3),
  ('Australian Wagyu Ribeye (12 oz)','2023 Zuccardi Q Malbec','Red','Australian Wagyu''s intense intramuscular fat needs the structured tannins of this Malbec to cleanse the palate, while the wine''s dark chocolate and violet notes elegantly frame the beef''s buttery, umami-rich flavor.',NULL,2),
  ('Australian Wagyu Ribeye (12 oz)','Black Saddle','Cocktail','Australian Wagyu''s intensely marbled, buttery fat calls for something bold enough to stand up to it — the cocktail''s bittersweet chocolate and smoky maple provide contrast without overwhelming the beef''s luxurious texture.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2018 Roland Champion Grand Cru ''Special Club''','Sparkling Wine','The golden apple and hazelnut richness of this Blanc de Blancs-style Champagne complements the sweet lump crab, while the citrus aioli echoes the wine''s lemon curd brightness and keeps the pairing fresh and animated.',NULL,3),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2021 Fullerton Five Faces Chardonnay','White','Ripe peach and golden apple in the Chardonnay complement the mango purée''s tropical sweetness, while the wine''s lively acidity lifts the richness of the crab cake and echoes the brightness of the citrus aioli.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2021 Schramsberg Blanc de Blanc 375ml','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s white peach and honeysuckle aromatics complement the sweetness of mango purée, while its creamy effervescence lifts the richness of the crab cake and the citrus aioli reinforces the wine''s zesty, minerally finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2022 Bastian Jolivet St. Joseph "Clef de Sol"','White','The wine''s apricot and white peach notes echo the mango purée, and its waxy, medium-bodied weight stands up to the crab cake''s richness without overpowering the delicate crabmeat — the citrus aioli also harmonizes beautifully with the wine''s mineral finish.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2023 Anne Pichon ''Sauvage'' Viognier','White','The wine''s ripe peach and apricot notes mirror the mango purée, while its lush texture and bright acidity cut through the richness of the crab cake and lift the citrus aioli beautifully.',NULL,0),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2023 Cliff Lede Sauvignon Blanc','White','The wine''s bright grapefruit and white peach notes harmonize beautifully with the mango purée, while its lively acidity cuts through the richness of the crab cake and citrus aioli, amplifying the sweet, delicate crab flavor.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2023 Far Niente Chardonnay','White','Lump crab''s delicate sweetness is elevated by the wine''s honeyed apple and peach character, while the citrus aioli echoes the Chardonnay''s citrus zest finish and its acidity cleanses each rich bite.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2023 Fossil Point Chardonnay','White','The Chardonnay''s ripe peach and creamy texture mirror the sweetness of blue crab and mango purée, while its bright acidity cuts through the richness of the citrus aioli for a seamless, tropical-tinged pairing.',NULL,0),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2023 Hietz Eifel Riesling Kabinett','White','The wine''s white peach and citrus notes complement the mango purée beautifully while its crisp acidity lifts the richness of the crab cake and citrus aioli without overwhelming the delicate crab flavor.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2023 Roumier Lacoste Sauternes 375ml','Dessert','The mango purée mirrors the wine''s dried mango and ripe peach notes, while the Sauternes'' acidity cuts through the richness of the crab cake and the aioli, creating a textbook sweet-savory complement rooted in shared tropical fruit tones.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2024 Chateau Ducasse Blanc','White','The wine''s white peach and citrus notes complement the mango purée and citrus aioli, while its refreshing acidity lifts the richness of the crab cake without masking the delicate sweet crab flavor.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2024 Fontsainte Gris de Gris Rose','Rosé','Delicate blue crab is a natural fit for a light-bodied, herb-tinged rosé — the Provençal herb notes complement the citrus aioli, and the wine''s acidity balances the richness of the cake without overpowering the sweet crab.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2024 Leccia Ill de Beaute Rose','Rosé','The wine''s white peach and herbal garrigue character mirrors the mango purée and citrus aioli, while its medium body and clean minerality keep the delicate blue crab in the spotlight rather than overwhelming it.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2024 Lover Rose','Rosé','Wild strawberry and white peach notes in the wine echo the mango purée''s tropical sweetness, and the crisp acidity cuts through the richness of the citrus aioli, making each bite of crab taste fresher.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2024 Meinklang Osterriech Orange','Rosé','The wine''s peach skin and apricot notes find a natural counterpart in the mango purée, and its medium body with tannic grip cuts through the richness of the crab cake while the citrus aioli reinforces the wine''s lively finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','2024 Raptor Ridge Pinot Gris','White','The wine''s ripe pear and stone fruit notes mirror the mango purée while its lively acidity cuts through the richness of the crab and citrus aioli, keeping every bite bright and clean.',NULL,0),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Athletic Run Wild IPA NA 12oz Can','Beer','Tropical fruit and pine in the beer echo the mango purée and citrus aioli, while the dry, crisp finish contrasts the crab cake''s buttery interior without overwhelming the delicate crab flavor.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Bauman''s Oak St. Dry Cider','Cider','The citrus aioli and mango purée echo the cider''s citrus zest and fruit-forward character, while its bone-dry finish and light tannin cut through the richness of the crab, keeping each bite feeling fresh.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Bear''s Delight Honey Wheat','Beer','The light, floral sweetness of the wheat beer lifts the delicate blue crab without overwhelming it, and the mango purée echoes the beer''s ripe fruit character while the citrus aioli keeps the pairing bright and refreshing.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Blue Samurai','Cocktail','The cocktail''s orange blossom sweetness and citrus acidity play beautifully against the mango purée and citrus aioli, while its refreshing lightness keeps the richness of the blue crab cakes in check.',NULL,3),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Corona Extra 12oz Bottle','Beer','The light, clean lager body won''t overpower the delicate crab, and Corona''s faint citrus note echoes the citrus aioli and mango purée, tying the pairing together refreshingly.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Crown & Cane','Cocktail','Mango purée echoes the drink''s tropical banana and honey notes, while the cocktail''s bright lemon lift cuts through the richness of the crab cake and citrus aioli in perfect harmony.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Lemon Ginger Mojito','Cocktail','The cocktail''s bright citrus and ginger warmth complement the mango purée and citrus aioli, echoing the tropical, zesty notes while the mint and bubbles keep the delicate crab flavor from being overwhelmed.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Mango Caliente','Cocktail','The mango purée in the crab cakes mirrors the cocktail''s tropical fruit core, while the citrus aioli echoes the lime acidity, creating a seamless flavor bridge; the chili heat gently elevates the delicate sweetness of the blue crab.',NULL,0),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Almacita Pinot Noir Brut Rose','Rosé','The wine''s strawberry and cream notes harmonize with the mango purée''s tropical sweetness, while its bubbles provide a refreshing counterpoint to the richness of the crab cake.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Bottex Bugey Cerdon Rose','Rosé','The wine''s delicate fruitiness and clean acidity complement the sweet, briny crab without overwhelming it, and the mango purée echoes the off-dry, candied fruit character of the Cerdon perfectly.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Champalou Vouvray Brut','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s honeysuckle and quince notes harmonize beautifully with the mango purée, while its bright acidity lifts the richness of the crab and citrus aioli — the brioche hint from lees aging also subtly echoes the golden-seared crust of the cake.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Fourny et Fils Brut Rose 1er Cru','Rosé','The brioche and red-cherry notes in this rosé Champagne mirror the richness of blue crab while the mango purée''s tropical sweetness finds a complementary partner in the wine''s strawberry and raspberry fruit — acidity keeps the buttery crab cake from feeling heavy.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V J. Lassalle Brut 1er Cru ''Preference''','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s bright apple and lemon zest notes complement the sweetness of blue crab, and its acidity balances the richness of the citrus aioli; the mango purée finds a flattering echo in the wine''s subtle honeyed finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Marchesine Fraciacorta ''Nitens'' Brut DOCG','Sparkling Wine','The Franciacorta''s bright peach and citrus character mirrors the mango purée and citrus aioli, while its creamy mousse balances the delicate sweetness of blue crab — acidity keeps every bite feeling fresh and light.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Pierre Sparr Cremant D''Alsace','Sparkling Wine','The Crémant''s light body and citrus-driven acidity mirror the citrus aioli and balance the sweet, delicate crab meat without overpowering it, while the touch of brioche in the wine echoes the golden, pan-seared crust of the cakes.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Sommariva Prosecco Superior','Sparkling Wine','The peach and floral notes in this Prosecco mirror the mango purée beautifully, while the wine''s lively bubbles and acidity balance the richness of the crab cake and creamy citrus aioli.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Soter Estate Brut Reserve','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s lemon curd and white peach brightness contrast the richness of the crab cake while harmonizing with the citrus aioli, and the persistent mousse lifts the dish''s delicate sweetness beautifully.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Treveri Cellars Blanc de Blanc 375ml','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s white peach and citrus notes harmonize beautifully with the mango purée and citrus aioli, while its effervescence keeps the richness of the crab cakes from feeling heavy.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','N/V Tutela Organic Prosecco 200ml','Sparkling Wine','The zippy acidity and light body cut through the richness of the crab cake while the mango purée mirrors the Prosecco''s white peach and tropical fruit character, creating a seamless bridge between dish and glass.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Original Hard Cider','Cider','The cider''s tart citrus notes and lively effervescence mirror the citrus aioli and mango purée, while its crisp acidity keeps the richness of the crab cake feeling light and fresh.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Prickly Pear Pale Ale','Beer','The ale''s sweet-tart prickly pear mirrors the mango purée while its citrusy hop character echoes the citrus aioli, and the crisp bitterness cuts cleanly through the richness of the crab cake.',NULL,0),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Radio Silence','Cocktail','The sweet, tropical mango purée and citrus aioli echo the cocktail''s floral nectar and lemon zest, while the delicate crab meat is never overpowered by the light agave backbone — complementary sweetness with a clean, refreshing finish.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Shock Value','Cocktail','The honeyed floral notes of Lillet and the bright citrus of Cointreau play beautifully against the mango purée and citrus aioli, while the cocktail''s acidity lifts the richness of the crab cakes.',NULL,3),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Snow Dust Rice Lager','Beer','The beer''s soft, slightly creamy mouthfeel bridges beautifully with the crab cake''s sweet crab meat, while the mango purée''s tropical brightness echoes the lager''s faint floral notes.',NULL,2),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Stella Artois 0% 12oz Bottle','Beer','The clean, lightly sweet malt character of this lager echoes the delicate sweetness of blue crab, and the gentle carbonation refreshes the palate between bites of the rich citrus aioli and mango purée.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Stella Artois 12oz Bottle','Beer','The beer''s light body and dry finish keep it from overwhelming the delicate crab, and its subtle floral hop note plays nicely against the citrus aioli and tropical sweetness of the mango purée.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','The Violet Hour','Cocktail','The silky sweetness of crème de violette mirrors the mango purée while the cocktail''s lemon citrus and botanical backbone cut through the richness of the crab cake and brighten the citrus aioli.',NULL,1),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Velvet Honey','Mocktail','The mocktail''s ripe peach and honey notes mirror the mango purée while its bright citrus lift echoes the citrus aioli, creating a lush tropical harmony that flatters the sweet, delicate crab without overwhelming it.',NULL,0),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','White Claw Mango 12oz Can','Seltzer','The mango purée in the crab cakes mirrors the seltzer''s tropical fruit note exactly, creating a seamless echo while the crisp carbonation cuts through the richness of the crab and aioli, keeping each bite fresh.',NULL,0),
  ('Blue Crab Cakes','Wild River IPA Series','Beer','The IPA''s tropical mango and grapefruit notes echo the crab cake''s mango purée and citrus aioli, while the firm bitterness cuts through the richness of the crab and fried exterior for a seamless, complementary match.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','10th Avenue Amber','Beer','The toasted malt and toffee notes complement the deep, beefy crust of a dry-aged bone-in ribeye, and the amber''s medium body and clean finish hold their own against the steak''s fat without overwhelming the meat''s nuanced flavor.',NULL,3),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2018 La Louviere Rouge Pessac-Leognan','Red','The wine''s firm tannins and dark-fruit depth are a classic counterpoint to the rich marbling and bold, beefy intensity of a dry-aged bone-in ribeye; the bright acidity cuts through fat and keeps each bite fresh.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2019 Sesti Brunello di Montalcino','Red','The bone-in ribeye''s intense marbling and caramelized crust create a natural counterpart to the Brunello''s dark cherry fruit and structured tannins, which grip the fat beautifully and let the wine''s tobacco and leather complexity come forward on the finish.',NULL,1),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2020 Guido Porro Barolo ''Vigna Lazzairasco''','Red','The bone-in ribeye''s beefy intensity and generous fat cap harmonize with the Barolo''s full structure and dark cherry fruit, while the wine''s dusty tannins grip the protein and its lingering mineral finish keeps each bite fresh.',NULL,1),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2021 Chakana Estate Malbec','Red','The Malbec''s full body and velvety tannins are a textbook match for the intense marbling and dry-aged depth of a bone-in ribeye — the wine''s dark fruit and mocha finish mirror the beef''s rich, savory crust.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2021 Sang de Cailloux Vacqueyras Rouge','Red','The Vacqueyras''s firm tannins and bright acidity cut beautifully through the rich, beefy fat of a dry-aged ribeye, while the wine''s smoked meat, black olive, and garrigue notes mirror the deep savory crust on the bone-in cut.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2022 Chateau Retout Haut-Medoc','Red','The ribeye''s intense marbling and dry-aged depth match the wine''s medium-full body and firm tannins perfectly, while the wine''s lively acidity cuts through the fat and its dark fruit and cedar notes mirror the beef''s savory richness.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2022 Far Niente Post & Beam Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The bold dark fruit and velvety tannins of this Cabernet cut through the intense marbling and char of the dry-aged bone-in ribeye, while the wine''s cocoa and cedar notes mirror the beef''s savory, umami-rich crust.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2022 Gros Nore Bandol Rouge','Red','The bone-in ribeye''s marbled fat and dry-aged umami soften the Mourvèdre''s grippy tannins beautifully, and the wine''s black olive and earthy finish amplifies the savory complexity of the beef without overwhelming it.',NULL,1),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2022 Nickle & Nickle Branding Iron Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The ribeye''s heavy marbling and bold, beefy char are a natural counterpart to this Cab''s plush tannins and dark fruit core — the wine''s structure cuts through the fat while mocha and cedar notes echo the dry-aged crust.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2022 Riofavara Nero d''Avola ''Spaccaforno''','Red','The Spaccaforno''s velvety tannins and dark cherry fruit are a textbook match for the marbled richness of a dry-aged bone-in ribeye — the wine''s bright acidity cuts through the fat while its dark spice and tobacco notes echo the char of the crust.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2023 Chave Selections Croze Hermitage Rouge ''Silene''','Red','The wine''s firm, polished tannins and savory iron-tinged minerality are a textbook match for the rich, beefy fat of a dry-aged bone-in ribeye; the blackberry and dark cherry fruit cuts through the marbling while cracked pepper notes echo the steak''s caramelized crust.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2023 Clos Coutale Cahors Malbec','Red','The ribeye''s abundant marbling, dry-aged funk, and charred crust are a natural counterpart to Cahors Malbec''s grippy tannins and dark fruit — the wine''s firm structure cuts through fat while its earthy leather and graphite notes echo the beef''s savory depth.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2023 Gundlach Bundchu Mountain Cuvee','Red','The wine''s dark cherry and blackberry fruit mirrors the rich, beefy intensity of the dry-aged ribeye, while its smooth tannins grip the fat beautifully and the balanced acidity cuts through to refresh the palate with each bite.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2023 Isenhower Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The ribeye''s generous marbling and char-kissed crust are a classic match for this Cab''s firm tannins, which cut through fat beautifully, while the wine''s dark fruit and cedar echo the steak''s savory depth.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2023 Ridge Three Valleys Zinfandel','Red','The Zinfandel''s ripe blackberry and bramble fruit echo the caramelized crust of a dry-aged ribeye, while its plush tannins and lively acidity cut through the generous marbling and fat, making each bite feel fresh.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2023 Vieux Telegraphe Chateauneuf du Pape','Red','The wine''s full body, silky tannins, and black cherry fruit stand up beautifully to the intense marbling and char of a dry-aged bone-in ribeye, while its iron and earthy garrigue notes echo the deeply savory, mineral qualities of prime beef.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2023 Zuccardi Q Malbec','Red','The ribeye''s heavy marbling and charred, savory crust are a textbook match for this Malbec — the wine''s velvety tannins cut through the fat while blackberry and plum fruit mirror the beef''s natural richness, and the mocha finish echoes the char.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','2024 Friend & Farmer Tempranillo','Red','The Tempranillo''s firm tannins and dark cherry fruit are tailor-made for a well-marbled dry-aged ribeye — fat softens the tannins while the wine''s lively acidity cuts through richness, and the cedar-tobacco finish echoes the deep, beefy char.',NULL,0),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','Black Saddle','Cocktail','The dry-aged ribeye''s deep beefy fat and char are a natural match for the Black Saddle''s roasted coffee and dark caramel notes, with the rye bite cutting through the richness the same way a peppercorn crust would.',NULL,1),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','Heck''s Czech Dark Lager','Beer','The medium-full body and creamy mouthfeel hold up to the rich fat and umami of a dry-aged ribeye, while the roasted bread and dark chocolate character echoes the char on the crust without overwhelming the beef.',NULL,1),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','Kettlehouse Cold Smoke 16oz Can','Beer','The medium-full, silky body of Cold Smoke stands up to the fat and char of a dry-aged bone-in ribeye, with roasted malt flavors acting as a counterpart to the steak''s crust and the very low bitterness keeping the palate from fatigue.',NULL,2),
  ('Bone-In Ribeye (22 oz)','Steakhouse 74','Mocktail','The mocktail''s smoky char and cracked black pepper notes mirror the crust of a dry-aged ribeye, while its lively citrus acidity cuts through the fat and its caramelized stone fruit sweetness amplifies the beef''s natural richness — a near-perfect flavor echo.',NULL,0),
  ('Broccolini','2023 Broc Cellars ''Amore Rosso''','Red','Sumac''s tart, citrusy edge aligns with the wine''s vibrant acidity, while the brown butter and garlic add savory depth that grounds the wine''s lighter-bodied fruit — a surprisingly harmonious match.',NULL,3),
  ('Broccolini','2024 Field Recordings Skins Orange','Rosé','Brown butter and sumac on the broccolini speak directly to this wine''s nutty finish and pleasantly bitter close, while the garlic''s savory depth plays off the dried herb and earthy undertones running through the mid-palate.',NULL,3),
  ('Broccolini','2024 Meinklang Osterriech Orange','Rosé','Brown butter''s nuttiness and sumac''s tart, floral acidity are a textbook complement to this orange wine''s chamomile and orange peel finish, with the wine''s grippy structure standing up to the garlic''s pungency.',NULL,3),
  ('Caviar Service','2018 Roland Champion Grand Cru ''Special Club''','Sparkling Wine','The toasty brioche and almond notes in this Grand Cru echo the richness of caviar, while the lemon curd acidity and persistent mousse cut through the salt and fat for a classic, luxurious pairing.',NULL,1),
  ('Caviar Service','2021 Schramsberg Blanc de Blanc 375ml','Sparkling Wine','Blanc de Blancs and caviar is one of the great classic pairings — the wine''s crisp acidity and creamy mousse contrast beautifully with the rich, saline pop of roe, while its toasted brioche character mirrors traditional blini accompaniments.',NULL,1),
  ('Caviar Service','2023 D''Epire Savennieres','White','The wine''s beeswax texture and laser acidity cut beautifully through the richness of caviar, while its concentrated minerality echoes the sea-salt intensity of the roe without overpowering its delicacy.',NULL,1),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V Bottex Bugey Cerdon Rose','Rosé','Bugey Cerdon is a classic pairing with caviar — the fine persistent bubbles, low alcohol, and restrained sweetness provide a lush textural contrast to the salinity of the roe without competing with its delicate oceanic flavor.',NULL,3),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V Champalou Vouvray Brut','Sparkling Wine','Vouvray Brut''s mineral, chalky finish is a natural partner for caviar''s oceanic salinity, and the wine''s restrained honeyed richness provides just enough contrast to the egg''s unctuousness without overwhelming the delicate roe.',NULL,3),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V Chartogne Taillet ''Cuvve Ste Anne''','Sparkling Wine','The creamy mousse and bright lemon zest of the Cuvée Ste Anne provide the classic, time-honored pairing with caviar — the wine''s subtle brioche note harmonizes with buttery accompaniments while the mineral, chalky finish amplifies the caviar''s salinity without overwhelming its delicacy.',NULL,1),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V J. Lassalle Brut 1er Cru ''Preference''','Sparkling Wine','The toasty brioche quality and persistent mousse of this Premier Cru Champagne are a natural counterpoint to the rich, oceanic salinity of caviar, elevating both without overpowering either — a classic luxury pairing.',NULL,1),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V Marchesine Fraciacorta ''Nitens'' Brut DOCG','Sparkling Wine','Sparkling wine and caviar is one of the great classical pairings; the wine''s toasted brioche and almond notes echo traditional blini accompaniments while its mineral lift and effervescence amplify the caviar''s oceanic salinity without overwhelming it.',NULL,1),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V Pierre Sparr Cremant D''Alsace','Sparkling Wine','Sparkling wine and caviar is one of the great classic pairings — the wine''s fine, persistent bubbles and dry minerality provide the ideal neutral backdrop that amplifies the salinity of the roe without competing with its delicate, buttery complexity.',NULL,3),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V Soter Estate Brut Reserve','Sparkling Wine','Bubbles and high acidity cleanse the palate between bites of caviar, while the brioche and almond notes in the wine echo classic caviar accompaniments like blinis and crème fraîche.',NULL,1),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V Treveri Cellars Blanc de Blanc 375ml','Sparkling Wine','A classic pairing: the yeasty brioche character of this méthode traditionnelle sparkling wine is a natural companion to caviar''s briny, buttery richness, while fine bubbles cleanse the palate between bites.',NULL,3),
  ('Caviar Service','N/V Tutela Organic Prosecco 200ml','Sparkling Wine','Sparkling wine and caviar is a timeless pairing — the fine, persistent bubbles and clean almond-biscuit finish complement the briny, buttery pop of the roe without competing, letting the caviar''s luxury take center stage.',NULL,3),
  ('Caviar Service','The Iron Sage','Cocktail','The Iron Sage''s clean vodka base and bone-dry, briny finish provide the neutral salinity that classic caviar service demands, while the herbal and peppercorn notes add just enough complexity to elevate without competing.',NULL,3),
  ('Center-Cut Filet Mignon (8 oz)','2019 Belles Graves Lalande de Pomerol','Red','The filet''s lean, tender beef lets the Lalande''s velvety tannins and plush dark fruit shine without competition, while the wine''s integrated acidity cuts through the butter-rich finish of a dry-aged cut.',NULL,0),
  ('Center-Cut Filet Mignon (8 oz)','2021 Hirsch San Andreas Fault Pinot Noir','Red','The filet''s lean, tender profile and subtle beefy flavor are a textbook match for a cool-climate Pinot Noir — the wine''s fine-grained tannins won''t fight the meat, and its mouthwatering acidity keeps each bite fresh.',NULL,1),
  ('Center-Cut Filet Mignon (8 oz)','2021 Shea Cellars Estate Pinot Noir','Red','The filet''s tender, delicate fat structure is a natural match for Pinot Noir''s fine-grained tannins and medium body — neither overwhelms the other — and the wine''s dark cherry brightness cuts cleanly through the beef''s richness.',NULL,1),
