  ('Honey-Cured Candied Bacon','2023 La Tour Vielle Banyuls ''Rimage'' 500ml','Dessert','The Banyuls'' dark cherry and bittersweet chocolate richness beautifully mirrors the sweet-savory glaze of the candied bacon, while its gentle spirit warmth cuts through the fat and the crushed red pepper echo amplifies the wine''s subtle spice.',NULL,0),
