  ('Honey-Cured Candied Bacon','Graham''s Tawny Porto 10 Year','Port','The port''s sweet dried-fruit richness and caramel notes mirror the honey cure, while its gentle acidity cuts through the fat, and the red pepper heat is tempered by the wine''s velvety sweetness — a classic sweet-heat synergy.',NULL,0),
  ('Honey-Cured Candied Bacon','Hardy''s Tawny Porto 10 Year','Port','The port''s caramel, dried fruit sweetness, and spice echo the honey cure while the crushed red pepper heat is softened by the wine''s smooth, round body — a classic sweet-heat synergy.',NULL,0),
