  ('Honey-Cured Candied Bacon','N/V Bottex Bugey Cerdon Rose','Rosé','The wine''s off-dry red berry sweetness and lively acidity are a natural counterpoint to the salty, smoky bacon and the heat of crushed red pepper — the gentle effervescence cuts through the richness and keeps each bite fresh.',NULL,0),
