  ('Jumbo Asparagus','2023 Domaine Trotereau Quincy','White','Meyer lemon and olive oil on the asparagus create an almost seamless bridge to the wine''s citrus-driven, mineral profile, while the wine''s lively acidity counterbalances the slight bitterness of the asparagus for a classically refreshing pairing.',NULL,3),
  ('Jumbo Asparagus','2023 Fossil Point Chardonnay','White','Meyer lemon on the asparagus echoes the wine''s citrus-zest finish, and the Chardonnay''s lively acidity and medium body complement the grassy, slightly bitter character of the jumbo asparagus without overwhelming it.',NULL,3),
  ('Jumbo Asparagus','2023 Vajra Langhe Bianco ''Dragon''','White','The wine''s Alpine herbal lift and bright lemon zest are a natural complement to asparagus dressed with olive oil and Meyer lemon — a pairing where the green, grassy notes of both align seamlessly.',NULL,2),
  ('Jumbo Asparagus','2024 Brisa Suave Vihno Verde 1 Liter','White','Extra virgin olive oil and Meyer lemon on the asparagus echo the wine''s white-peach and citrus-peel notes, and the wine''s refreshing acidity complements the vegetal, slightly bitter character of the jumbo asparagus beautifully.',NULL,3),
  ('Jumbo Asparagus','2024 Caldaro Pinot Grigio','White','The Meyer lemon on the asparagus draws out the wine''s own lemon zest and white peach notes, and the wine''s clean acidity balances the richness of the olive oil for a seamless, food-friendly pairing.',NULL,3),
