  ('Jumbo Asparagus','2024 Satellite Sauvignon Blanc','White','Grassy, herbaceous notes in the Sauvignon Blanc resonate with the asparagus''s vegetal character, while the Meyer lemon dressing and the wine''s citrus acidity create a bright, cohesive bridge.',NULL,3),
