  ('Jumbo Asparagus','Original Hard Cider','Cider','The cider''s bright acidity and orchard fruit quality echo the Meyer lemon and olive oil dressing on the asparagus, creating a clean, complementary pairing where both the dish and the drink feel equally light and vibrant.',NULL,3),
