  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','Mint Citrus Fizz','Mocktail','The clean, crisp carbonation and citrus brightness act like a classic mignonette, cutting through the briny, mineral richness of the oysters and leaving the palate refreshed and ready for the next shell.',NULL,2),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Almacita Pinot Noir Brut Rose','Rosé','The wine''s lively acidity and fine bubbles cut through the brine of fresh oysters while its delicate red fruit and minerality echo the sea-kissed finish — a textbook sparkling rosé pairing.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Champalou Vouvray Brut','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s chalky minerality and bright acidity are a textbook mirror to the briny, saline quality of raw oysters, while the delicate mousse cleanses the palate between each shell — one of the great classic pairings in wine.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Chartogne Taillet ''Cuvve Ste Anne''','Sparkling Wine','The Champagne''s briny minerality and fine mousse are a textbook complement to fresh oysters — the chalky Champagne terroir mirrors the salinity of the shell, while the lively acidity cuts through any oceanic richness and lifts the clean, briny finish.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Fourny et Fils Brut Rose 1er Cru','Rosé','The Champagne''s fine mousse, bright acidity, and mineral-driven finish are a textbook match for briny, delicate oysters — the wine''s red-fruit lift and citrus zest cut through the salinity and amplify the ocean freshness.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V J. Lassalle Brut 1er Cru ''Preference''','Sparkling Wine','Champagne and oysters is a textbook pairing for good reason: the wine''s chalky minerality and laser-like acidity mirror the briny, saline character of the oysters, while the fine mousse cleanses the palate between each shell.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Marchesine Fraciacorta ''Nitens'' Brut DOCG','Sparkling Wine','The Franciacorta''s lively acidity and creamy mousse are a classic match for briny, mineral oysters — the wine''s citrus zest and fine bubbles cut through the salinity and cleanse the palate between each shell.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Pierre Sparr Cremant D''Alsace','Sparkling Wine','The Crémant''s crisp acidity and fine minerality are a textbook match for briny oysters, cleansing the palate between each bite while the wine''s lemon zest and subtle floral notes echo the clean, oceanic freshness of the shellfish.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Sommariva Prosecco Superior','Sparkling Wine','Prosecco''s crisp acidity and fine bubbles are a textbook match for briny oysters — the wine''s salinity-enhancing effervescence lifts the mineral, oceanic flavor while the lightly off-dry finish softens any metallic edge.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Soter Estate Brut Reserve','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s bright acidity and fine mousse cut through the salinity of the oysters while its chalky minerality mirrors the brininess of the half shell — a textbook pairing that elevates both.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Treveri Cellars Blanc de Blanc 375ml','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s bright acidity and fine bubbles cut through the salinity of fresh oysters, while green apple and lemon zest echo the classic mignonette pairing — a textbook match that makes both shine.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','N/V Tutela Organic Prosecco 200ml','Sparkling Wine','Prosecco''s crisp acidity and saline mineral edge are a classic match for raw oysters — the lively bubbles cleanse the palate between each shell while the floral, apple notes echo the ocean brine without overwhelming the delicate liquor.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','New Haikkado Rice Lager 16oz Can','Beer','The lager''s delicate rice sweetness and clean, low-bitterness finish act as a palate refresher between bites, letting the natural brine of the oysters shine without competing — classic ''less is more'' pairing where the beer''s neutrality is a virtue.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','PBR 16oz Can','Beer','Crisp, low-bitterness lager is a textbook companion for briny raw oysters — the carbonation cleanses the palate and the beer''s lightness never overwhelms the delicate oyster liquor.',NULL,2),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','Radio Silence','Cocktail','The cocktail''s bright elderflower and lemon snap act like a classic mignonette, lifting the briny, mineral salinity of fresh oysters while the egg white''s creamy froth mirrors the oysters'' silky texture — a near-perfect weight and contrast match.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','Shock Value','Cocktail','The drink''s crisp, aromatic profile — citrus, cucumber, floral Lillet — is a classic complement to briny oysters on the half shell, with the subtle anise note from the absinthe spray adding a classic oyster-bar elegance.',NULL,1),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','Snow Dust Rice Lager','Beer','The lager''s clean crispness and gentle carbonation act as a palate refresher between bites, while its subtle rice sweetness complements the briny, delicate salinity of fresh oysters without overwhelming them.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','Stella Artois 0% 12oz Bottle','Beer','The light body and minimal bitterness avoid overwhelming the delicate brine of the oysters, while the faint floral hop notes and gentle carbonation provide a refreshing contrast to their briny, oceanic finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','Stella Artois 12oz Bottle','Beer','Stella''s clean, bready malt and gentle carbonation echo the classic lager-and-oyster pairing tradition — the dry finish amplifies the briny, oceanic minerality of the half-shell oysters without competing with them.',NULL,2),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','The Iron Sage','Cocktail','The cocktail''s brine and salinity act as a direct mirror to the mineral, oceanic liquor of a freshly shucked oyster — salt calls to salt — while the herbal bitterness and peppercorn heat cut through the richness and cleanse the palate between bites.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','The Violet Hour','Cocktail','The cocktail''s floral violet and herbal gin notes act as a aromatic counterpoint to briny, mineral oysters — a classic surf-and-flowers pairing where the tart citrus finish cleanses the palate between each shell.',NULL,0),
  ('Oysters on the Half Shell (Half Dozen)','White Claw Black Cherry 12oz Can','Seltzer','The clean, neutral carbonation and dry finish act like a squeeze of lemon on a freshly shucked oyster — amplifying the briny, oceanic flavor without competing, making each shell taste crisper and livelier.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2018 Royal Tokaji Red Label 5 Puttonyos 500ml','Dessert','Point Reyes blue cheese is a classic foil for Tokaji — the wine''s luscious sweetness contrasts the cheese''s sharp, salty funk in the tradition of Sauternes-Roquefort, while the cracked black pepper amplifies the wine''s subtle spice notes.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2022 Auctioneer Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream''s bold salt and cracked pepper create a classic high-contrast pairing with Cabernet — the fat and funk of the blue cheese coat the palate and tame the tannins, while the wine''s ripe fruit cuts cleanly through the richness.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2022 Cliff Lede Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream''s bold, tangy funk and cracked black pepper create a classic contrast with the wine''s ripe plum and cassis, while the cream tempers the tannins for a smooth, indulgent pairing on a dry-aged steak.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2022 Gros Nore Bandol Rouge','Red','Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream''s bold, salty funk and cracked black pepper create a classic contrast with the wine''s dark fruit and leather, while the sauce''s fat and salt help tame the tannins — a pairing that flatters both.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2023 Isenhower Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','Point Reyes blue cheese''s bold, creamy salinity provides a contrasting counterpoint that softens the wine''s tannins, while the cracked pepper aligns with the Cab''s dusty sage and toasted oak finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2023 La Tour Vielle Banyuls ''Rimage'' 500ml','Dessert','Point Reyes blue cheese carries bold, salty funk and creamy weight that contrasts brilliantly with the wine''s lush fruit sweetness — a classic fortified wine and blue cheese dynamic — while the cracked black pepper ties into the cocoa-tinged finish.',NULL,1),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2023 Ridge Three Valleys Zinfandel','Red','Point Reyes blue cheese has the bold, salty funk needed to stand up to a full-bodied Zinfandel, and the cracked black pepper amplifies the wine''s peppery spice notes while the cheese''s creaminess softens its tannins.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2023 Roumier Lacoste Sauternes 375ml','Dessert','Point Reyes blue cheese is a classic Sauternes partner — the wine''s concentrated sweetness and acidity balance the cheese''s sharp, funky salinity, and the cracked black pepper adds a spice note that echoes the ginger and saffron in the wine''s bouquet.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','2023 Zuccardi Q Malbec','Red','Point Reyes blue cheese cream''s pungent saltiness and cracked pepper create a classic contrast with the Malbec''s ripe, fruit-forward sweetness, while the wine''s full body holds its own against the sauce''s bold, creamy weight.',NULL,3),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','Dow''s Tawny Porto 10 Year','Port','Point Reyes blue cheese is a classic tawny port partner — the wine''s nutty, caramel sweetness contrasts the cheese''s sharp, salty intensity, and its refreshing acidity keeps the rich cream sauce from feeling heavy.',NULL,2),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','Graham''s Tawny Porto 10 Year','Port','Point Reyes blue cheese is a textbook match for Tawny Port: the wine''s oxidative nuttiness and dried-fruit sweetness counterbalance the cheese''s sharp, salty funk, while its smooth body stands up to the richness of the cream sauce.',NULL,1),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','Hardy''s Tawny Porto 10 Year','Port','Blue cheese''s pungent, salty intensity is a textbook complement to aged tawny port; the walnut and caramel notes in the wine bridge beautifully with the cracked pepper creaminess of this sauce.',NULL,1),
  ('Point Reyes Blue Cheese Cream','N/V Paolo Fallabrino ''Alcyone'' Tannat 500ml','Dessert','Point Reyes blue cheese is bold and funky enough to stand up to Tannat''s powerful tannins, while the wine''s sweet dark fruit and chocolate notes provide a classic sweet-salty contrast that mirrors a port-and-Stilton pairing.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2018 La Louviere Rouge Pessac-Leognan','Red','A 30-oz porterhouse combines the tenderloin''s delicacy with the strip''s robust flavor, and the Pessac-Léognan''s cedar and graphite notes mirror the dry-aged character while its structured tannins stand up to the sheer size of the cut.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2019 Sesti Brunello di Montalcino','Red','The Porterhouse''s massive dry-aged beef flavor — deeply savory, richly marbled, with a pronounced crust — matches the Brunello''s full body and firm tannins stride for stride, while the wine''s bright acidity cuts through fat and its iron-earth minerality echoes the meat''s mineral savoriness.',NULL,0),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2020 Guido Porro Barolo ''Vigna Lazzairasco''','Red','The Porterhouse''s massive dry-aged beef character — concentrated, savory, and richly marbled — meets the Barolo''s firm tannins head-on, softening them while the wine''s bright acidity cuts through fat; the iron-tinged earthiness of Serralunga mirrors the deep umami of aged beef perfectly.',NULL,0),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2021 Podere Campriano Chianti Classico Riserva','Red','The Porterhouse''s sheer mass and concentrated dry-aged beefiness demand a wine with structural backbone — the Chianti Riserva''s firm tannins and balsamic-edged acidity stand up to every cut while keeping the palate refreshed.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2022 Auctioneer Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The Porterhouse''s massive marbling and dry-aged depth demand a structured Cabernet like this one — the firm tannins bind with the beef''s fat while the dark fruit mirrors the meat''s savory richness, and the cedar and tobacco finish echoes the char on the crust.',NULL,0),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2022 Chateau Retout Haut-Medoc','Red','A porterhouse''s combination of strip and tenderloin gives two textures for this Haut-Médoc to work with; the wine''s polished tannins tame the generous fat while its blackcurrant and earthy minerality echo the meat''s concentrated, dry-aged character.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2022 Cliff Lede Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The Porterhouse''s massive dry-aged beef flavor and generous fat cap demand a full-bodied red — the Cab''s plush tannins cut through the richness while dark cassis and mocha mirror the deep, savory char of the crust.',NULL,0),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2022 Gros Nore Bandol Rouge','Red','The Porterhouse''s massive, dry-aged beef richness meets its match in Bandol Rouge''s firm tannins and concentrated dark fruit, while the wine''s garrigue and smoked-meat notes echo the char and mineral depth of the crust — a textbook pairing of weight and structure.',NULL,0),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2022 Nickle & Nickle Branding Iron Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','A 30-oz porterhouse gives you both the rich strip and the tender filet, offering a full canvas for the wine''s layered blackberry, currant, and earthy minerality to shine alongside every bite.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2023 Clos Coutale Cahors Malbec','Red','A 30 oz porterhouse delivers both the tenderloin''s delicacy and the strip''s bold, beefy intensity, giving the wine''s full body and lively acidity something substantial to grip; the smoked-meat finish on the Malbec mirrors the char of a large-format steak perfectly.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2023 Gundlach Bundchu Mountain Cuvee','Red','A 30 oz porterhouse delivers two textures and flavor profiles — the robust strip and the buttery tenderloin — that both find harmony with this wine''s medium-full body, integrated tannins, and dark fruit, making it an ideal match for the cut''s sheer scale and complexity.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2023 Isenhower Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The porterhouse combines the richness of a strip with the tenderness of a filet, giving the wine''s full body and layered cassis-and-plum fruit a canvas worthy of its weight and long, oak-warmed finish.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','2023 Vieux Telegraphe Chateauneuf du Pape','Red','A 30-oz porterhouse gives you both the richness of a strip and the tenderness of a filet — the wine''s structured tannins cut through the fat while its cracked pepper and roasted herb finish mirrors the crust of a well-seared dry-aged cut.',NULL,1),
  ('Porterhouse (30 oz)','Pig''s Ass Porter','Beer','A 30-oz dry-aged Porterhouse has the sheer weight and savory depth to stand up to this full-bodied porter; the beer''s roasted espresso and cocoa character acts like a natural sauce, complementing the beef''s crust and amplifying its umami richness.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2018 Royal Tokaji Red Label 5 Puttonyos 500ml','Dessert','The wine''s orange marmalade and dried fruit notes echo the sweetness of the roasted beets, while its bright acidity balances the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette; the earthy minerality of the Tokaj ties beautifully to the earthiness of the beets.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2021 Hirsch San Andreas Fault Pinot Noir','Red','Roasted beets mirror the wine''s dark cherry and dried rose petal notes, while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette echo its mineral-driven acidity, creating a seamless earthy-fruit harmony.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2021 Shea Cellars Estate Pinot Noir','Red','Earthy roasted beets mirror the wine''s forest floor and dried rose petal notes, while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette play off its bright acidity, making this a classically complementary vegetable pairing for Oregon Pinot.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2022 Bastian Jolivet St. Joseph "Clef de Sol"','White','The honeysuckle and almond notes in the wine find a lovely counterpoint in the earthy roasted beets and tangy chèvre, and the sherry vinaigrette''s acidity aligns neatly with the wine''s own bright, lively backbone.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2022 Gerard & Morin Sancerre ''Chene Marchand''','White','The wine''s flinty minerality and citrus precision play beautifully against the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette, while its acidity cuts through the creamy Boursin pear and complements the peppery arugula — a classic Loire Sauvignon Blanc and goat cheese affinity at work.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2022 Guillemot Sauvigny-Les-Beaune ''Les Grands Picotins''','Red','Roasted beets mirror the wine''s wild strawberry and dried rose notes in a near-perfect complementary echo, while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette align beautifully with the Pinot''s bright acidity and subtle minerality.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2022 Vinum Pinot Noir','Red','Earthy roasted beets mirror the Pinot''s forest-floor undertones, while tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette align with the wine''s bright acidity, and the peppery arugula plays off its lingering spice finish.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2023 Anne Pichon ''Sauvage'' Viognier','White','The wine''s ginger spice and floral lift contrast beautifully with the earthy roasted beets, while its stone-fruit character harmonizes with the pear and chèvre, and the sherry vinaigrette echoes the wine''s bright acidity.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2023 Averaen Pinot Noir','Red','Roasted beets share the wine''s earthy, berry-driven character, and the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette mirror the Pinot''s bright acidity, creating a harmonious, complementary pairing.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2023 Broc Cellars ''Amore Rosso''','Red','Roasted beets share the wine''s earthy, berry-forward character, and the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette mirror its lively acidity — this is a textbook complementary pairing that makes both the food and wine taste brighter.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2023 Hietz Eifel Riesling Kabinett','White','The Riesling''s floral character and gentle residual sweetness echo the roasted beets and Boursin pear, while its acidity plays off the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette for a bright, balanced contrast.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2023 Kermit Lynch Cotes du Rhone','Red','Roasted beets share the wine''s earthy, red-fruit character, and the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette mirror the wine''s bright acidity, while peppery arugula amplifies the cracked black pepper lift on the finish.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2023 Mienklang Burgenland Osterreich Red','Red','Roasted beets mirror the wine''s dark fruit character while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette play off its acidity, making this a surprisingly harmonious vegetable pairing that highlights the wine''s herbal, earthy underpinnings.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2023 Roumier Lacoste Sauternes 375ml','Dessert','Earthy roasted beets and tangy chèvre provide a savory, acidic contrast that makes the wine''s honeyed richness pop, while the sherry vinaigrette and sweet onion find common ground with the Sauternes'' complex oxidative and caramelized undertones.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2023 Saint Marie Bourgogne Blanc','White','The toasted brioche and subtle stone minerality in the wine complement the earthy roasted beets and creamy chèvre, while the wine''s lively acidity balances the richness of Boursin and ties neatly into the sherry vinaigrette.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Field Recordings Skins Orange','Rosé','The wine''s dried apricot and chamomile notes mirror the sweetness of roasted beets and Boursin pear, while its tannic grip and sherry-like oxidative quality echo the sherry vinaigrette — the chèvre''s lactic tang ties the whole pairing together beautifully.',NULL,0),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Leccia Ill de Beaute Rose','Rosé','The rosé''s crushed rose petal and herbal garrigue notes find a natural partner in the earthy roasted beets and tangy chèvre, while its bright acidity balances the richness of the Boursin pear and ties the sherry vinaigrette together seamlessly.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Lover Rose','Rosé','Earthy roasted beets and tangy chèvre find a natural counterpart in the rosé''s red-fruit freshness and mineral backbone, while the sherry vinaigrette''s acidity aligns beautifully with the wine''s lively finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Meinklang Osterriech Orange','Rosé','Earthy beets and creamy chèvre echo the orange wine''s herbal, earthy undertones, while the sherry vinaigrette''s acidity aligns beautifully with the wine''s energetic brightness and the dried apricot notes play off the Boursin pear.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Pallieres ''Au Petite Bonheur'' Rose','Rosé','The sherry vinaigrette''s tang and the chèvre''s creamy tartness mirror the rosé''s crisp acidity and subtle earthiness, while the beet''s natural sweetness draws out the wine''s white peach and wild strawberry fruit.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Raptor Ridge Cuvee Pinot Noir','Red','Roasted beets echo the Pinot''s red fruit and violet aromatics, and the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette mirror the wine''s lively acidity, making this a classic, complementary earth-meets-fruit pairing.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Raptor Ridge Pinot Gris','White','Honeydew and white peach in the wine echo the Boursin pear and beet sweetness, while the jasmine aromatics play beautifully against the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Thierry Germain Saumur Champigny','Red','Roasted beets share a deep earthiness with Cab Franc''s pencil shaving and crushed stone minerality, while the chèvre''s tanginess echoes the wine''s bright acidity and the sherry vinaigrette ties it together with a complementary herbal, savory thread.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Thivin Cote de Brouilly','Red','Roasted beets mirror the Côte de Brouilly''s wild blueberry and crushed violet character, while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette echo the wine''s bright acidity and mineral finish — an elegant, earth-to-earth match.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','2024 Tour de Bon Bandol Rose','Rosé','The sherry vinaigrette''s tangy acidity aligns with the wine''s lively palate, the earthy beets find a complement in the rosé''s mineral backbone, and the creamy chèvre is softened by the wine''s cleansing finish — a classically structured pairing.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','Bear''s Delight Honey Wheat','Beer','Roasted beets share an earthy sweetness that resonates with the beer''s floral honey warmth, while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette provide a bright contrast that highlights the beer''s clean, grainy finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','Crown & Cane','Cocktail','Roasted beet''s earthy sweetness and the chèvre''s tang contrast beautifully with the floral honey and ginger warmth of the cocktail, while the sherry vinaigrette bridges the drink''s own subtle acidity.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','Dow''s Tawny Porto 10 Year','Port','Roasted beets share the port''s dried-fruit and earthy depth, and the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette mirror the wine''s oxidative complexity, while the Boursin pear reinforces its golden raisin and vanilla notes.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','Hardy''s Tawny Porto 10 Year','Port','Roasted beets share an earthy sweetness that mirrors the port''s dried fig and raisin character, while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette provide enough acidity to keep the pairing lively and balanced.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','N/V Almacita Pinot Noir Brut Rose','Rosé','Earthy roasted beets mirror the wine''s rose petal and red fruit character, and the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette align naturally with the sparkling rosé''s acidity and subtle brioche creaminess.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','N/V Bottex Bugey Cerdon Rose','Rosé','The earthy sweetness of roasted beets mirrors the wine''s wild strawberry and cherry fruit, while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette align beautifully with Cerdon''s bright acidity and floral lift.',NULL,1),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','N/V Fourny et Fils Brut Rose 1er Cru','Rosé','Roasted beets share an earthy sweetness that echoes the wine''s rose-petal and red-fruit character, while the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette align perfectly with the Champagne''s mineral acidity and dry, elegant structure.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','N/V Sommariva Prosecco Superior','Sparkling Wine','The wine''s delicate sweetness and floral character complement the earthy roasted beets and tangy chèvre, while its acidity plays nicely against the sherry vinaigrette without competing with the wine''s subtle almond finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','Prickly Pear Pale Ale','Beer','Earthy roasted beets and tangy chèvre find a natural complement in the ale''s berry-forward fruit and floral hops, while the sherry vinaigrette''s acidity aligns with the beer''s crisp, tart finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','Radio Silence','Cocktail','Earthy roasted beets and tangy chèvre create a satisfying contrast to the cocktail''s perfumed florals, and the sherry vinaigrette''s acidity aligns with the lemon-driven lift, making the pairing feel cohesive rather than competing.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','The Violet Hour','Cocktail','Earthy roasted beets and tangy chèvre find a natural echo in the cocktail''s floral, lightly sweet character, while the sherry vinaigrette''s acidity aligns with the drink''s clean tart finish for a harmonious, light pairing.',NULL,2),
  ('Roasted Heirloom Beet Salad','Velvet Honey','Mocktail','The drink''s honey and vanilla softness contrasts beautifully with the tangy chèvre and sherry vinaigrette, while its floral peach notes complement the roasted beet and pear, tying every element of this salad together.',NULL,2),
  ('Seafood Tower (Serves Two)','2018 Roland Champion Grand Cru ''Special Club''','Sparkling Wine','The medium-full body and mouthwatering acidity hold up to the weight of a full seafood tower — shrimp, crab, and lobster all find a lift from the bright apple and citrus notes, while the saline finish ties seamlessly to the sea flavors.',NULL,2),
  ('Seafood Tower (Serves Two)','2022 Savary Chablis ''Vaillons''','White','The wine''s crisp acidity and sea-shell minerality elevate every element of the tower — from shrimp and crab to lobster — while the citrus and green apple notes complement the cocktail and citrus accompaniments without overpowering the delicate seafood.',NULL,1),
  ('Seafood Tower (Serves Two)','2023 Clos Saint Magdeliene Cassis Blanc','White','A seafood tower spanning shellfish, crustaceans, and cold preparations finds an ideal partner in this Cassis Blanc''s layered citrus, wild fennel, and coastal minerality — the wine''s weight and acidity are perfectly calibrated to lift each element without overpowering delicate textures.',NULL,1),
  ('Seafood Tower (Serves Two)','2023 Neboa Albarino','White','The seafood tower''s mix of chilled shellfish, crab, and shrimp plays directly into Albariño''s coastal character — the wine''s citrus zest and saline lift echo the natural brine of the seafood while the lively acidity keeps every bite feeling fresh.',NULL,1),
  ('Seafood Tower (Serves Two)','N/V Marchesine Fraciacorta ''Nitens'' Brut DOCG','Sparkling Wine','A seafood tower is the Franciacorta''s natural playground — its fine bubbles, mineral backbone, and white-fruit brightness lift shrimp, lobster, and crab alike, tying the whole spread together with consistent refreshment between bites.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2022 Gerard & Morin Sancerre ''Chene Marchand''','White','The citrus ponzu dressing shares the wine''s bright acidic profile, creating a seamless bridge, while the Sancerre''s medium-light body respects the delicate texture of the seared tuna rather than overpowering it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2022 Punta Crena Vermentino ''Vigneto Isasco''','White','The citrus ponzu on the tataki shares the wine''s citrus and saline register, creating a seamless complementary bridge, while the Vermentino''s medium body and clean bitter finish keep up with the lean, umami-rich tuna without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2023 Cliff Lede Sauvignon Blanc','White','The citrus ponzu on the tataki mirrors the wine''s lemongrass and grapefruit profile, creating a complementary citrus-on-citrus brightness, while the wine''s medium body and crisp acidity keep pace with the lean, clean flavors of the seared tuna.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2023 Domaine Trotereau Quincy','White','The citrus ponzu dressing aligns beautifully with the wine''s bright citrus and grassy notes, and the lean, focused acidity of the Quincy keeps pace with the delicate, clean flavors of the seared tuna without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2023 Neboa Albarino','White','The citrus ponzu on the tuna tataki harmonizes with the wine''s lemon and white peach notes, while Albariño''s medium body and clean minerality complement the delicate, clean flavor of lightly seared tuna without overwhelming it.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2023 Picpoul Pomerols','White','Picpoul''s citrus-driven profile and crisp acidity are complementary partners to the citrus ponzu, and its light body won''t overwhelm the delicate, silky tuna — the chalky mineral finish lingers cleanly after each bite.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2023 Vajra Langhe Bianco ''Dragon''','White','The wine''s white peach and citrus notes harmonize with the ponzu''s bright acidity, while its medium-light body doesn''t overpower the delicate seared tuna, letting the microgreens echo the wine''s herbal character.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Brisa Suave Vihno Verde 1 Liter','White','The citrus ponzu dressing shares the wine''s lemon-zest brightness, creating a seamless flavor bridge, while the wine''s light body and crisp finish keep pace with the delicate, lean tuna without overpowering it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Caldaro Pinot Grigio','White','The wine''s bright citrus and green apple notes harmonize beautifully with the citrus ponzu, while its refreshing acidity cuts through the richness of the seared tuna without competing with its delicate flavor.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Field Recordings Skins Orange','Rosé','The bright, vibrant acidity of this skin-contact rosé cuts cleanly through the tuna''s richness, while the citrus ponzu amplifies the wine''s golden fruit and orange blossom character, and the earthy tannic finish keeps the delicate fish from being overwhelmed.',NULL,1),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Fontsainte Gris de Gris Rose','Rosé','The wine''s white peach, citrus zest, and saline finish align beautifully with the citrus ponzu, while its light body and bright acidity match the clean, lean texture of seared tuna without competing with it.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Leccia Ill de Beaute Rose','Rosé','The bright acidity of the rosé harmonizes beautifully with the citrus ponzu, while its fresh strawberry and floral notes provide a complementary lift to the clean, lean tuna without competing with its subtle oceanic character.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Lover Rose','Rosé','The wine''s minerality and citrus zest harmonize seamlessly with the ponzu''s bright, tangy character, while its light body complements the delicate texture of seared tuna without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Meinklang Osterriech Orange','Rosé','The wine''s bright acidity and dried stone-fruit character mirror the citrus ponzu''s tang, while its subtle tannins from skin contact add just enough grip to complement the seared tuna''s meaty texture without overwhelming it.',NULL,0),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Pallieres ''Au Petite Bonheur'' Rose','Rosé','The light body and citrus-forward acidity of the rosé harmonize beautifully with the ponzu-dressed tuna, while the wine''s herbal, floral lift complements the delicate microgreens without overwhelming the fish.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Pratsch Grunerveltiner 1 Liter','White','The citrus ponzu dressing echoes the wine''s zesty citrus and clean mineral notes, and the medium body of the Grüner stands up to the meaty seared tuna without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Satellite Sauvignon Blanc','White','The wine''s passionfruit and grapefruit notes mirror the citrus ponzu, and its light body matches the delicate seared tuna without overwhelming it — a seamless complementary pairing.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Tiamo Organic Pinot Grigio','White','The citrus ponzu echoes the wine''s lemon-zest and green-apple notes, while the Pinot Grigio''s light body and lively acidity provide a refreshing counterpoint to the silky, fatty tuna.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','2024 Tour de Bon Bandol Rose','Rosé','The citrus ponzu dressing mirrors the wine''s bright acidity and citrus character, while the wine''s medium body and herbal wild-herb notes are substantial enough to complement the seared, meaty tuna without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Athletic Run Wild IPA NA 12oz Can','Beer','The IPA''s grapefruit and citrus notes mirror the ponzu dressing while the moderate bitterness cuts cleanly through the tuna''s richness, keeping each bite bright and lifted.',NULL,0),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Bauman''s Oak St. Dry Cider','Cider','The citrus ponzu dressing shares the cider''s bright acidity and zesty lift, creating a seamless flavor bridge, while the cider''s medium body and clean finish complement the delicate, lean tuna without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Blue Samurai','Cocktail','The cocktail''s yuzu and lemon-forward acidity mirrors the citrus ponzu on the tataki, while the clean sake base echoes the delicate seared tuna without overwhelming it — a textbook complement of like flavors at matching light weight.',NULL,0),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Lemon Ginger Mojito','Cocktail','The citrus ponzu on the tuna shares a citrus-forward profile with the mojito, and the cocktail''s ginger kick amplifies the Asian-inspired seasoning while its light body matches the dish''s delicate weight.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Mango Caliente','Cocktail','The citrus ponzu''s bright acidity locks in with the lime element of the cocktail, while the seared tuna''s lean, clean flavor lets the mango sweetness and chili warmth shine as a vibrant counterpoint rather than compete.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Michelob Ultra 12oz Bottle','Beer','The beer''s citrus hint echoes the ponzu''s brightness, and its light body won''t mask the delicate, clean flavor of seared tuna — the dry finish also resets the palate between each piece.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Mint Citrus Fizz','Mocktail','The citrus ponzu dressing shares the same zesty lemon-lime register as the mocktail, creating a harmonious citrus-on-citrus echo, while the lively carbonation lifts the delicate seared tuna without overpowering it.',NULL,1),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','N/V Chartogne Taillet ''Cuvve Ste Anne''','Sparkling Wine','The citrus ponzu''s bright acidity aligns seamlessly with the wine''s lemon zest and white peach character, while the Champagne''s fine mousse and clean mineral finish provide a refreshing contrast to the silky, lightly seared tuna.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','New Haikkado Rice Lager 16oz Can','Beer','The citrus ponzu''s bright acidity mirrors the lager''s dry, clean finish, while the beer''s soft carbonation lifts the richness of the seared tuna without overwhelming its delicate flavor.',NULL,1),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Prickly Pear Pale Ale','Beer','The light body and citrusy hop notes of the pale ale harmonize with the citrus ponzu without overwhelming the delicate tuna, and the dry, refreshing finish keeps each bite feeling clean and vibrant.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Radio Silence','Cocktail','Citrus ponzu mirrors the cocktail''s bright lemon snap and clean agave edge, while the silky, lightly seared tuna matches the drink''s gentle, frothy texture — a seamlessly complementary pairing in both acidity and delicacy.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Shock Value','Cocktail','The citrus ponzu on the tuna tataki mirrors the cocktail''s fresh citrus and acidity, while the light body of the drink keeps pace with the delicate seared fish without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Sierra Nevada Pale Ale 12oz Bottle','Beer','The citrus ponzu mirrors the ale''s bright citrus zest character, and the beer''s moderate bitterness provides a clean counterpoint to the delicate, fatty tuna without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Snow Dust Rice Lager','Beer','The citrus ponzu''s bright acidity mirrors the beer''s dry, clean finish, and the lager''s light body won''t compete with the tuna''s delicate texture — a classic lean-protein-meets-crisp-lager harmony.',NULL,1),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','The Violet Hour','Cocktail','The citrus ponzu''s bright acidity and the tuna''s delicate umami are a seamless match for the cocktail''s lemon whisper and herbal gin complexity, keeping both food and drink feeling light, fresh, and coastal.',NULL,3),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','White Claw Black Cherry 12oz Can','Seltzer','The citrus ponzu''s tangy, umami-driven brightness mirrors the seltzer''s clean tartness, and the light body of both the drink and the seared tuna keep the pairing delicate and refreshing without either overpowering the other.',NULL,1),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','White Claw Mango 12oz Can','Seltzer','The seltzer''s dry citrus finish aligns naturally with the citrus ponzu, and its light effervescence lifts the delicate seared tuna without overwhelming it — a textbook weight-matched pairing.',NULL,1),
  ('Seared Tuna Tataki','Wild River IPA Series','Beer','The citrus ponzu mirrors the IPA''s grapefruit and lemon zest character, and the beer''s clean malt backbone is light enough not to overwhelm the delicate seared tuna, creating a bright, cohesive pairing.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2018 La Louviere Rouge Pessac-Leognan','Red','The shiitake and berry elements in the demi-glace echo the wine''s earthy minerality and dark-fruit core, amplifying both the sauce and the wine''s mocha-tinged finish in a seamless loop of flavor.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2019 Belles Graves Lalande de Pomerol','Red','The shiitake and berry reduction in the demi-glace is a natural bridge to the wine''s earthy depth and cassis-forward fruit, making any steak course feel seamlessly integrated with the Right Bank''s terroir-driven character.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2019 Sesti Brunello di Montalcino','Red','The shiitake and berry reduction in this demi-glace mirrors the Brunello''s own earthiness and dark fruit core, creating a seamless bridge between sauce and wine that amplifies both without one overpowering the other.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2020 Guido Porro Barolo ''Vigna Lazzairasco''','Red','The shiitake and berry complexity of the demi-glace echoes the wine''s own layers of dried fruit and earthy depth, creating a seamless bridge between sauce and glass that amplifies the savory, long finish of the Lazzairasco.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2021 Chakana Estate Malbec','Red','The demi-glace''s shiitake umami and berry reduction amplify the Malbec''s dark fruit and smoky oak, creating a seamless bridge between sauce and wine that makes every bite taste more complex.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2021 Hirsch San Andreas Fault Pinot Noir','Red','The demi-glace''s shiitake and berry reduction is practically a flavor map of this Pinot — earthy umami and red fruit align directly with the wine''s forest floor and wild strawberry character, amplifying both.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2021 Podere Campriano Chianti Classico Riserva','Red','The shiitake and berry notes in the demi-glace echo the wine''s tobacco-and-dark-fruit layers almost seamlessly, with the sauce''s richness softened by the wine''s lively acidity and savory, herb-tinged finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2021 Shea Cellars Estate Pinot Noir','Red','The shiitake and berry components in the demi-glace echo the wine''s own savory earthiness and dark fruit character, deepening both when paired together — ideal spooned over the filet or a lighter cut alongside this Pinot.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Ancient Peaks Merlot','Red','The shiitake and berry notes in the demi-glace are nearly a mirror image of this Merlot''s mocha and dark fruit character, creating a seamless bridge between wine and plate that amplifies the depth of both.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Auctioneer Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The Signature Demi-Glace''s shiitake-and-berry reduction is a near-mirror image of the wine''s earthy, dark-fruit profile — layered over a Prime steak, it creates a seamless bridge between the sauce and the Cab''s long cocoa-and-vanilla finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Chateau Retout Haut-Medoc','Red','The shiitake and berry notes in the demi-glace mirror the wine''s dark fruit and tobacco finish almost seamlessly, amplifying both the sauce and the Haut-Médoc''s earthy, structured character when paired with any prime steak on the menu.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Cliff Lede Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The Signature Demi-Glace''s shiitake earthiness and berry reduction are a near-perfect complement to the Cab''s violet, dark fruit, and cocoa finish, amplifying the wine''s complexity alongside any prime cut.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Far Niente Post & Beam Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The shiitake and berry elements in the demi-glace echo the wine''s dark fruit and earthy undertones, creating a seamless bridge that amplifies the depth of both the sauce and the Cabernet''s long finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Gros Nore Bandol Rouge','Red','The Signature Demi-Glace''s shiitake, berry, and fine herb profile mirrors the wine''s own earthy, dark-fruit, and dried-herb character, making this sauce a bridge that deepens both the steak and the Bandol simultaneously.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Guillemot Sauvigny-Les-Beaune ''Les Grands Picotins''','Red','The shiitake and berry components in the demi-glace act as a seamless bridge to the wine''s earthy, red-fruit core, amplifying its forest-floor complexity while the fine herbs echo the violet and spice notes on the finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Leonetti Cellars Merlot','Red','The demi-glace''s shiitake umami and berry reduction echo the Merlot''s mocha and dark fruit layers, creating a seamless bridge between sauce and wine that amplifies the savory depth of any steak it accompanies.',NULL,1),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Nickle & Nickle Branding Iron Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The shiitake and berry reduction in the demi-glace mirrors the wine''s own dark fruit and umami depth, creating a seamless, amplifying loop of savory complexity on the finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Riofavara Nero d''Avola ''Spaccaforno''','Red','The Signature Demi-Glace''s shiitake earthiness and berry reduction mirror the Nero d''Avola''s dried fig, dark fruit, and earthy minerality, amplifying both the sauce and the wine''s savory depth.',NULL,1),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2022 Vinum Pinot Noir','Red','The shiitake and berry notes in the demi-glace act as a direct flavor bridge to the Pinot''s earthy, red-fruit profile, making this accompaniment (ideally alongside the filet or strip) feel like a seamless extension of the wine itself.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2023 Averaen Pinot Noir','Red','The demi-glace''s shiitake depth and berry reduction are a near-mirror of the Pinot''s forest-floor and dark-fruit notes, amplifying the wine''s complexity when drizzled over a lighter cut like the filet.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2023 Chave Selections Croze Hermitage Rouge ''Silene''','Red','The shiitake and berry notes in the demi-glace are essentially a mirror of the wine''s own earthy, violet-tinged profile, creating a seamless harmony that amplifies the depth of any dry-aged steak it accompanies.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2023 Gundlach Bundchu Mountain Cuvee','Red','The shiitake and berry notes in the demi-glace echo the wine''s mocha and dark fruit character almost seamlessly, amplifying the earthy depth of both and creating a cohesive, savory-rich finish on the palate.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2023 Isenhower Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The shiitake and berry notes in the demi-glace mirror the wine''s own earthy minerality and dark fruit, creating a seamless bridge that amplifies both the sauce and the wine''s complexity.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2023 La Tour Vielle Banyuls ''Rimage'' 500ml','Dessert','The signature demi-glace''s shiitake umami and berry reduction echo the wine''s dried fig, blackberry preserve, and cocoa character, creating a seamless flavor bridge that makes this a compelling dessert-wine-and-savory pairing for guests lingering over a final course.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2023 Vieux Telegraphe Chateauneuf du Pape','Red','The shiitake and berry elements in the demi-glace are a mirror image of Vieux Telegraphe''s earthy depth and dark fruit — layering complementary umami and subtle sweetness that amplifies the wine''s long, savory finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2024 Friend & Farmer Tempranillo','Red','The Signature Demi-Glace''s shiitake umami and berry reduction echo the wine''s earthy-dark fruit profile almost note for note, creating a seamless bridge between sauce and glass that makes every steak bite more complete.',NULL,3),
  ('Signature Demi-Glace','2024 Raptor Ridge Cuvee Pinot Noir','Red','The demi-glace''s shiitake and berry components are a direct mirror of the Pinot''s earthy undertones and red fruit core, deepening the savory finish of any steak without overpowering the wine''s elegance.',NULL,3),
  ('Tomahawk Ribeye (40 oz)','2022 Auctioneer Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','A 40 oz Tomahawk Ribeye is one of the rare cuts bold enough to match this wine''s full body and polished tannins; the intense intramuscular fat softens the tannin structure while the wine''s blackcurrant and plum amplify the beef''s natural umami.',NULL,1),
  ('Traditional Caesar','2024 Field Recordings Skins Orange','Rosé','The wine''s nutty, slightly oxidative undertones are a natural complement to aged Parmesan and white anchovy, and its textural grip stands up to the creamy, umami-driven dressing in a way a lighter rosé simply could not.',NULL,2),
  ('Traditional Caesar','Sierra Nevada Pale Ale 12oz Bottle','Beer','The umami depth of white anchovy and aged Parmesan finds balance in the ale''s biscuity malt, while the hop bitterness refreshes the palate against the richness of the Caesar dressing.',NULL,3),
  ('Traditional Caesar','The Iron Sage','Cocktail','The cocktail''s resinous herb lift and sharp salinity align naturally with the anchovy, aged Parmesan, and herb crouton — every component is salty, savory, and umami-forward, making the pairing feel seamless and mutually amplifying.',NULL,2),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','2019 Belles Graves Lalande de Pomerol','Red','Truffle mac & cheese mirrors the wine''s signature earthy, truffle-laced finish, while the fontina and provolone''s creamy fat softens the tannins and amplifies the dark chocolate undertone on the mid-palate.',NULL,2),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','2022 Ancient Peaks Merlot','Red','The earthy truffle and creamy fontina-provolone blend complement the wine''s cedar, vanilla, and mocha undertones, while the richness of the cheese sauce is cut cleanly by the Merlot''s balanced acidity.',NULL,3),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','2022 Leonetti Cellars Merlot','Red','Truffle''s earthy, woodsy notes complement the cedar and mocha undercurrents in this Merlot, and the fontina and aged cheddar blend provides a creamy richness that softens the tannins for a luxurious pairing.',NULL,3),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','2023 Gundlach Bundchu Mountain Cuvee','Red','Truffle''s earthy umami and the fontina''s nuttiness contrast the wine''s bright dark fruit while harmonizing with its toasted oak and spice, making this an indulgent, surprisingly well-matched pairing.',NULL,3),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','2023 La Tour Vielle Banyuls ''Rimage'' 500ml','Dessert','The earthy truffle and rich, melted fontina-provolone blend find a natural counterpart in the Banyuls'' bittersweet chocolate and espresso notes, with the wine''s sweetness and velvety body matching the dish''s indulgent depth without overwhelming it.',NULL,2),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','Black Saddle','Cocktail','Truffle Mac & Cheese bridges the earthy, umami lane the cocktail already travels — the fontina and aged cheddar richness harmonize with cocoa and caramel, while truffle''s mustiness amplifies the drink''s lingering smoky finish.',NULL,3),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','Kettlehouse Cold Smoke 16oz Can','Beer','Truffle''s earthy, umami depth finds a natural partner in Cold Smoke''s roasted malt and dark chocolate character, while the beer''s creamy texture matches the richness of the fontina and aged cheddar without overwhelming the dish''s subtle truffle aroma.',NULL,3),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','N/V Paolo Fallabrino ''Alcyone'' Tannat 500ml','Dessert','The earthy truffle and richly melted fontina and provolone echo the wine''s cocoa and dried violet notes, while the dish''s fat content softens Tannat''s firm tannins into a lush, velvety finish.',NULL,2),
  ('Truffle Mac & Cheese','Pig''s Ass Porter','Beer','Truffle''s earthy, funky depth and the fontina-provolone-cheddar blend create a savory richness that locks perfectly onto the porter''s roasty, chocolatey backbone, with the beer''s low bitterness keeping the dairy from feeling heavy on the palate.',NULL,3),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2018 La Louviere Rouge Pessac-Leognan','Red','Wagyu tartare''s unctuous, buttery richness and the savory punch of caper and farm egg yolk are beautifully balanced by the wine''s firm tannin structure and tobacco-edged complexity, while the acidity lifts the dish without overwhelming its subtle elegance.',NULL,3),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2019 Belles Graves Lalande de Pomerol','Red','Raw Wagyu tartare echoes the wine''s earthy, truffle-like depth and savory richness, and the bright caper and sweet onion provide just enough lift to complement the Merlot-dominant fruit profile.',NULL,1),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2019 Sesti Brunello di Montalcino','Red','The Wagyu tartare''s rich fat and umami from the egg yolk and caper provide just enough weight to engage the Brunello''s tannins, while the wine''s acidity and dried herb finish lift the dish and keep each bite feeling clean and focused.',NULL,3),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2020 Guido Porro Barolo ''Vigna Lazzairasco''','Red','The raw, mineral richness of Wagyu tartare with its briny capers and fatty egg yolk provides a delicate counterpoint to the Barolo''s firm tannins and acidity, while the wine''s leather and dried herb notes complement the dish''s savory, umami-forward profile without overwhelming it.',NULL,3),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2021 Hirsch San Andreas Fault Pinot Noir','Red','The wine''s savory forest-floor character and bright acidity cut through the richness of the egg yolk and complement the umami of capers and sweet onion, while its silky tannins won''t overwhelm the delicate raw beef.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2021 Podere Campriano Chianti Classico Riserva','Red','The Wagyu tartare''s umami-rich fat, briny capers, and egg yolk create a lush canvas that the wine''s roasted-tomato and balsamic character ties together, while its acidity lifts the dish and keeps each bite clean.',NULL,3),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2021 Sang de Cailloux Vacqueyras Rouge','Red','The wine''s iron-rich earthiness and crushed violet complement the raw, mineral quality of the Wagyu tartare, while its acidity lifts the richness of the egg yolk and the briny pop of caper.',NULL,1),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2021 Shea Cellars Estate Pinot Noir','Red','The lean, umami-rich beef and bright acidic accents of caper and sweet onion echo the wine''s savory forest-floor undercurrent and lifted acidity, while the silky tannins glide over the raw texture without overpowering it.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2022 Ancient Peaks Merlot','Red','The rich, fatty Wagyu tartare echoes the wine''s dark fruit and chocolate notes, while the bright caper and onion provide a contrasting pop of acidity that mirrors the Merlot''s own balanced freshness.',NULL,1),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2022 Chateau Retout Haut-Medoc','Red','Wagyu tartare''s silky fat and umami-forward profile are lifted by the wine''s bright acidity, while the capers and sweet onion echo the wine''s herbal and earthy undertones for a surprisingly elegant pairing.',NULL,2),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2022 Far Niente Post & Beam Cabernet Sauvignon','Red','The raw richness of Wagyu tartare with egg yolk provides enough fat and umami to complement the wine''s full body, while the briny capers and sweet onion offer a gentle contrast that keeps the pairing lively.',NULL,3),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2022 Guillemot Sauvigny-Les-Beaune ''Les Grands Picotins''','Red','The wine''s lively acidity and earthy forest-floor notes cut through the richness of the egg yolk and wagyu fat, while its delicate red-fruit character complements the briny pop of capers and the savory depth of the tartare without overwhelming it.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2022 Leonetti Cellars Merlot','Red','The Wagyu tartare''s buttery fat and briny capers contrast beautifully with the wine''s bright acidity and dark cherry fruit, while the richness of the egg yolk mirrors the Merlot''s full, plush body.',NULL,2),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2022 Vinum Pinot Noir','Red','The lean, raw Wagyu with its savory fat, sweet onion, and briny caper is a classic partner for light-bodied Pinot Noir — the wine''s lively acidity cuts through the richness while red cherry and spice echo the dish''s delicate umami depth.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2023 Averaen Pinot Noir','Red','Wagyu tartare''s delicate fat and briny capers echo the wine''s earthy forest-floor undertone and pomegranate lift, while the refined tannins complement rather than overwhelm the raw beef''s subtle texture.',NULL,1),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2023 Broc Cellars ''Amore Rosso''','Red','The wine''s bright acidity and earthy spice cut through the richness of the egg yolk and complement the briny capers, while its light body won''t overwhelm the delicate raw beef — a classic bistro-style pairing.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2023 Chave Selections Croze Hermitage Rouge ''Silene''','Red','Syrah''s savory olive tapenade and smoked meat qualities mirror the umami depth of raw Wagyu, while the wine''s lively acidity lifts the richness of the egg yolk and the briny pop of capers creates a complementary savory bridge.',NULL,1),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2023 Clos Coutale Cahors Malbec','Red','Wagyu tartare''s rich, unctuous fat and umami-forward capers and egg yolk need the wine''s lively acidity and firm tannins to provide lift and definition, while the Malbec''s dark plum and earthy tobacco notes complement the raw beef''s mineral quality.',NULL,3),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2023 Kermit Lynch Cotes du Rhone','Red','The savory, earthy qualities of the Côtes du Rhône echo the capers and egg yolk while the wine''s bright acidity cuts through the richness of the beef fat, and its garrigue herb notes harmonize beautifully with the sweet onion.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2023 Mienklang Burgenland Osterreich Red','Red','The wine''s ripe dark cherry and earthy, peppery notes beautifully complement the rich umami of raw Wagyu and the briny pop of capers, while its lively acidity cuts through the fat of the egg yolk for a balanced, elegant bite.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2024 Friend & Farmer Tempranillo','Red','Wagyu tartare''s rich, buttery fat and savory capers are balanced by the Tempranillo''s firm tannins and acidity, while the wine''s dark fruit and spice add complexity without overwhelming the dish''s delicate raw beef flavor.',NULL,2),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2024 Raptor Ridge Cuvee Pinot Noir','Red','The wine''s bright acidity and earthy forest-floor notes cut through the richness of the egg yolk and wagyu fat, while its red fruit lifts the briny capers and sweet onion into a seamless, savory harmony.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2024 Thierry Germain Saumur Champigny','Red','The wine''s bright acidity and fine tannins cut through the richness of the egg yolk and wagyu fat, while its red fruit and graphite notes mirror the savory, mineral character of the tartare — a classic bistro pairing that highlights Cab Franc''s versatility with raw beef.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','2024 Thivin Cote de Brouilly','Red','The wine''s lively acidity and mineral edge cut through the richness of the egg yolk and fat of the Wagyu, while its ripe cherry fruit complements the briny pop of capers and sweet onion — a classic pairing of delicate red fruit with raw beef.',NULL,0),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','Steakhouse 74','Mocktail','The savory umami backbone of the drink locks in beautifully with the raw beef, caper brine, and egg yolk, while the citrus brightness lifts the dish and keeps each bite of tartare tasting clean and defined.',NULL,1),
  ('Wagyu Beef Tartare','The Iron Sage','Cocktail','The savory, dry finish and briny depth of The Iron Sage echo the capers and egg yolk in the tartare, while the building peppercorn heat bridges beautifully with the raw beef''s clean, iron-rich intensity.',NULL,1);
